<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Cishingini Agwara Kambari [asg]</book>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Katagarda ke Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="mt">NEHEMIYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuɓa̱yuwa̱</para>
  <para style="im">A̱ ciya̱ kuyeve vuza na u ɗanai katagarda ke Nehemiya ba. Katagarda ke Ezira n ka Nehemiya i ta̱ an nwalu koɓolo. Ali ma a katagarda ka ciɗa ka na a ɗanai n tsa aza a Ibirahi, katagarda ka Ezira n ke Nehemiya katagarda kete kaꞋa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ili i na katagarda ka nampa ki a kadanshi ɗaɗa e neke arabali tsu na Vuzavaguɗu u yotsongi usuɓi u ni a̱ ubuta̱ u kubono n uma a Isaraila a na uta̱i a iɗika i tsugbashi a kubana a Urushelima, n tsu na kpamu u maꞋasakai mashilya ma̱ likuci ma. Katagarda ka kpamu ko yotsongu ta̱ tsu na e nekei aza a Isaraila kadanshi o yongo n usuɓi o kuyotsongusu ku Musa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na ɗa ili i gita̱i punu a katagarda ke Nehemiya ka.</para>
  <para style="imi">1 Uboni u Nehemiya a Urushelima tsu na mogono ma Pashiya me nekei kadanshi adama a na wo okpo vuza vu tsugono a uɓon u Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="imi">2 A maꞋasakai mashilya ma Urushelima.</para>
  <para style="imi">3 UgaꞋin u kukece kuyotsongusu ku Musa n tsu na uma a Isaraila a̱ shika̱i unushi u le.</para>
  <para style="imi">4 Ulinga u Nehemiya u na u buwai o tsugono ci a uɓon u Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na yi punu</para>
  <para style="io1">Nehemiya u bonoi a Urushelima 1:1--2:20</para>
  <para style="io1">A maꞋasakai mashilya ma Urushelima 3:1--7:73</para>
  <para style="io1">E kecei kuyotsongusu ku Musa ɗa kpamu a sabasakai uzuwakpani 8:1--10:39</para>
  <para style="io1">Kagimi ka ulinga u Nehemiya 11:1--13:31</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Avasa e Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Na ɗa arabali e Nehemiya maku ma Hakaliya. A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko wotoi u Kishilebu ɗaɗa wotoi u kuci a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamanga ka na Atazesu wi a kulyaꞋa tsugono tsu Pashiya, mpa Nehemiya a̱ ubuta̱ u mashilya a Susa, a̱ likuci i gbayin yi iɗika ya. <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Ɗa Hanani vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ aza a̱ va̱ koɓolo n uma o yoku a na uta̱i a̱ likuci i Yahuda, a̱ ta̱wa̱i adama a na ene mu. Ɗa me ecei le arabali a Urushelima n arabali aza a Yahuda a na uta̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbashi na ɗe a Babila. <verse eid="NEH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Ɗa a danai mu,&lt;&lt;Kagimi ka uma a na uta̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbashi o bonoi, a na i a uɓon u Yahuda, i ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci ka̱u. Ɗa kpamu a danai mu a̱ fa̱da̱ ta̱ mashilya ma Urushelima ɗa kpamu o songi agbaguratsu a̱ utsutsu a̱ ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Ana m panai ukuna u nampa, ɗa n da̱sa̱ngu n shika̱i. Ayin n a̱bunda̱i mpa a̱ una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma, ɗa n yaꞋin kakuli n avasa u Ka̱shile ka gaɗi. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Ɗa n danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka gaɗi, vuzagbayin Ka̱shile ili i wovon. Avu na vu tsu shatangu uzuwakpani, vuza vu ucigi u na u tsu kpa̱ɗa̱ kusabaꞋa wa aza a na i a kuciga wu, ɗa kpamu i e kere wila̱ u nu, <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />mi ta̱ ufolu u nu zuwaka mu atsuvu, ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu la̱na̱ mu, vu pana avasa a kagbashi ka̱ nu, a na mi a kuyaꞋan kanna n kayin adama agbashi a̱ nu aza a Isaraila. Mi ta̱ a̱ kushika̱ unushi u na a̱tsu aza a Isaraila ci yaꞋankai nu. Mayun mpa ni ikaya i va̱ ci yaꞋanka wu ta̱ unushi. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Tsu nusaka wu ta̱ gbani-gbani a na tsu kpa̱ɗa̱i kuyaꞋan ili i na vu cigai. Ɗa kpamu tsu kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono kadanshi ka̱ nu n ili i kutono i nu n wila̱ u na vu neke kagbashi ka̱ nu Musa. <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Ciɓa n kadanshi ka na vu danai kagbashi ka̱ nu Musa. &lt;Ɗa baci i kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono wila̱ u va̱, mi ta̱ a kuwacuwa ɗa̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uduniya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">A Gan 26:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />ama i bono baci wa̱ a̱va̱ ɗa i tonoi wila̱ uva̱ u na n nekei ɗa̱, mi ta̱ o kuɓolongu ɗa̱ ko yi ishi baci i yawa uteku wa aduniyan, mi ta̱ o kubonoko ɗa̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u na n zagbai adama a na i cikpa kula ku va̱.&gt; <verse eid="NEH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />Ele agbashi a̱ nu aɗa, n uma a̱ nu kpamu. Aza a na vu shiba̱i n utsura u gbayin u nu. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Vuzavaguɗu, pana avasa a̱ va̱ kagbashi ka̱ nu n avasa agbashi a̱ nu a na buwai aza a na i a kupana uyoꞋo u tsugbayin tsu kula ku nu. N folono wu ta̱ neke kagbashi ka̱ nu ulyaꞋi anana, ka̱ta̱ vu zuwa u ciya̱ mapasa ma singai a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">A makyan ma nanlo ma mpa ɗa vuza na u tsu neke mogono ili i kusoꞋo.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">A̱ suki Nehemiya a kubana a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Ana wotoi u Nisan u lazai ɗaɗa wotoi u na̱shi a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamanga ko tsugono tsu Atazesu mogono. Ana a̱ tuka̱i ni m ma̱kya̱n, ɗa n ɗikai maꞋa m bankai mogono. Mogono tana ma saꞋwa kene una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ u va̱ ba sai makyan ma nampa. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Ɗa mogono me ecei mu,&lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ tsu nampa? Tana vi nu mɓa̱la̱ ba. Babu ili i na ya kuzuwa wu vu yongo tsu nampa sai vi a̱ una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Ɗa m panai wovon ka̱u. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Ɗa mu ushuki mogono n danai, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe mogono. Yiɗa̱i i kusa̱nka̱ mu una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱? Likuci i na a̱ ciɗa̱ngi ikaya i va̱ i ɗa yokpo ta̱ agali, ɗa kpamu o songi a̱ɓa̱ya̱ntsu a̱ utsutsu u likuci wa n akina.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Ɗa mogono ma danai mu, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i vu cigai n yaꞋanka wu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Ɗa n yaꞋin kavasa a kubana a̱ Ka̱shile ka gaɗi. <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />Ɗa n danai mogono,&lt;&lt;U gaꞋan baci mogono, ɗa kpamu mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu n ciya̱i mapasa ma singai wa̱ nu, mi ta̱ a kuciga vu suku mu a kubana a̱ likuci i Yahuda, a̱ likuci i na a̱ ciɗa̱ngi ikaya i va̱, adama a na m maꞋasaka likuci ya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />A makyan ma tana Egbere wi ta̱ lo ida̱shi ɗevu n mogono, ɗa mogono me ecei mu, &lt;&lt;Ayin a yaꞋin a ɗai ma kuyaꞋan? Wana ɗai kpamu mo kubono?&gt;&gt; Ana n danai ni. Ɗa wu ushuki ufolu uva̱, ɗa n danai ni makyan ma nwalu ma̱ va̱. <verse eid="NEH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Ɗa n danai mogono,&lt;&lt;U gaꞋan baci mogono, yaꞋan u ɗanaka mu katagarda ka na n kuneke i Gomuna yi uɓon u ɗakai e kuyene ku Yufiretu adama a na a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ mu n wala ali n yawa a̱ likuci i Yahuda babu kadama. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu neke mu katagarda ka na n kuneke Asafa vuza na wi a̱ kula̱na̱ kutsun ku mogono, u dana yi u neke mu nɗanga n na ma kuyaꞋanka aburakpatsu a utsutsu una u kuka̱na̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a, koɓolo n nshilya n likuci ma, kpamu n kpaꞋa ku na mpa n kuda̱sa̱ngu.&gt;&gt; Ɗa mogono me nekei mu ili ra̱ka̱ i na me ecei ni, adama a na kukiye ku Ka̱shile ki ta̱ koɓolo nu mpa. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ suki ovonshi osoji koɓolo n ka̱bunda̱i ko odoku a bana koɓolo nu mpa, ɗa n yaꞋin nwalu ma a kubana a kapashi ke kuyene ku Yufiretu ɗa n nekei i gomuna i le atagarda akaka o mogono a. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Ama ana Sanbala vuza vu Horon n Tobiya vuza kelime vu iɗika ya aza a Amona a panai vuma vu yoku u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama a na u lapula ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ ya aza a Isaraila, ɗa a̱ na̱mgbi ka̱tsuma ka̱u.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya u la̱na̱i aza a kumaꞋa mashilya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Ana n yawai a Urushelima, ɗa n yongoi biꞋi lo ali ayin a tatsu. <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />Ɗa n ɗa̱nga̱i n kayin, mpa n uma o yoku kenu. N dana ko vuza te ili na Ka̱shile ka zuwai a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱va̱ n yaꞋan adama a Urushelima ba. Babu manama ma na n ɗikai sai majaki ma na n kumbai koci. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Mu uta̱i n utsutsu u ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ a kubana a̱ a̱shi a̱ mini e kuyene ku Ka̱di n tsutsu u ka̱kiza̱, ɗa me enei mashilya ma Urushelima ma na ma̱ yikpa̱i n a̱ɓa̱ya̱ntsu a̱ utsutsu a na akina o songi va. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Ɗa m banai a̱ utsutsu u ka̱shi ka̱ mini n kuɗolu ku mogono, ama majaki ma na n kumbai va ma̱ ciya̱ ubuta̱ u kutono ba. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Nannai ɗa n tonoi punu a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka nu n la̱na̱i mashilya ma n kayin ka. Ɗa n kpatalai m bonoi n uye u na mu utuka̱i, m bonoi a̱ likuci n utsutsu u ka̱ra̱Ꞌa wa. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Babu vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ u yevei ubuta̱ u na mu uta̱i ko u yeve ili i na mi a kuciga kuyaꞋan. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu n dana uma a̱va̱ aza a Yahuda ukuna ba, ko tana anan ganu, ko aza e kelime, ko nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ko aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ulinga wa. <verse eid="NEH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Ɗa n danai le, &lt;&lt;Yene ta̱ atakaci a na tsu uwai, niniɗai Urushelima wo kokpo agali n tsu na akina o songi a̱ɓa̱ya̱ntsu a̱ ni. Ta̱wa̱i, tsu maꞋasakai mashilya ma Urushelima ma, adama a na ka̱ta̱ ci lyaꞋa kelime n kupana wono ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Ɗa tana n danai le tsu na kukiye ku Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ ki koɓolo nu mpa n ili na mogono ma danai mu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Ɗa ushuki, &lt;&lt;Ɗa̱nga̱i tsu gita̱ kumaꞋasaka mashilya ma.&gt;&gt; Ɗa tana a̱ ciya̱i ka̱ɗu ka kuyaꞋan ulinga u singai. <verse eid="NEH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Ama ana Sanbala vuza vu Horon, n Tobiya vuza kelime vu iɗika i Amona n Gesheru vuza vu Araba a panai ili na ci sheshei kuyaꞋan, ɗa a givai tsu n o zosoi. A danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i yi a kuyaꞋan? Yi ta̱ a kuciga kuyaꞋanka mogono ugbamukaci?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Ɗa mu ushuki le n danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱shile ka gaɗi ki ta̱ e kuneke tsu ulyaꞋi u na tsa kuyaꞋan u ɗa. A̱tsu aza a na ci a kuyaꞋanka yi tsugbashi ci ta̱ a̱ kugita̱ kumaꞋa ka. Ama a̱ɗa̱ yi n upecu, ko ili na a kuciɓasa n a̱ɗa̱ a Urushelima ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">A maꞋasakai mashilya ma Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Ɗa ganu vu gbayin vuza kula Eliyashibu koɓolo n aza a̱ ni anan ganu a na a buwai, ɗa a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i a maꞋasakai utsutsu wu ushiga wu nkyon. Ɗa a̱ shikpai ukungulu, ɗa erengi n ɗa. ɗa kpamu a maꞋi mashilya ma ɗa erengi maꞋa ili i na i ɗikai a kumaꞋa ku na ugaɗi u ni u yawai amangatawun (100) a kubana a kumaꞋa ku ugaɗi ku Hananelu. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Ɗa aza e Jeriko feu a̱ gita̱i kuyaꞋan kumaꞋa ka a̱ ubuta̱ u na kumaꞋa ku Eliyashibu ku shamgbai. Ɗa kpamu Zakuru maku ma Imiri feu u gita̱i kumaꞋa ka a̱ ubuta̱ u na aza e Jeriko a shamgbai. <verse eid="NEH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Ntsukaya n Hasena a maꞋin Utsutsu wa Adan. Ɗa a zuwakai u ɗa aburakpatsu, ɗa a yaꞋin iga̱Ꞌin yi utsutsu u kuꞋuwaka n agbaguratsu a iyim a kusaɓamgu utsutsu wa. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Meremotu maku ma Uriya vashi vu Hakozu, u gita̱i ku lapula ubuta̱ u na kumaci ku Hasena ku shamgbai n kumaꞋa ku le. Meshulamu maku ma Berekiya, vashi vu Meshezabelu u gita̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u na Meremotu u shamgbai, vuza na u tonoi a̱yi ɗa Zadoku maku ma BaꞋana. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Aza Tekowa ele ɗa aza a na a̱ gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Zadoku u shamgbai. Ama ɗa aza a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ e le a iwain kuyaꞋan ulinga n aza e kelime a kumaꞋa ka. <verse eid="NEH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Joyida maku ma Pashiya n Meshulamu maku ma Besodiya ele ɗa a lapulai Kakuci ka̱ Utsutsu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kakuci ka̱ Utsutsu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗaɗa feu e ci ɗeke utsutsu u Joyida.</char></note> ka. Ɗa a ukai kaburakpatsu a̱ utsutsu, ɗa a zuwai agbaguratsu a̱ iyum a̱ utsutsu u ni. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Melatiya vuza vu Gibiyon n Jadon vuza vu Meronotu koɓolo n uma a Gibiyon n aza a Mizipa, aza a na i a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko tsugono tsu gomuna vu uɓon ka̱livi ka upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu, ɗa a̱ gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Joyida n Meshulamu a shamgbai n ulinga. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Ɗa Uziyelu maku ma Harahiya kayimi ka azanariya, u yaꞋin kulapulu ku ni. Hananiya vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na a ci yaꞋan ili ma̱gula̱ni a̱yi feu u gita̱i kumaꞋa mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Uziyelu u shamgbai. Ɗa uma a maꞋasakai mashilya ma Urushelima ma ali a kubana a Mashilya ma n Washi. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Refaya maku ma Huru, vuza tsugono vu kagimi ka̱ likuci i Urushelima, ɗa u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Hananiya u shamgbai. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Jedayiya maku ma Haruma, a̱yi feu u lapulai mashilya ma ɗevu n kpaꞋa ku ni, a̱ ubuta̱ u na Refaya u shamgbai. Hatushi maku ma Hashabeniya a̱yi feu ɗa u lapulai mashilya ma a uteku u na Jedayiya u shamgbai.<verse eid="NEH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Malakija maku ma Harim n Hashubu maku ma Pahatu-mowabu ele ɗa a lapulai kapashi ko yoku ka mashilya n kumaꞋa ku ugaɗi ubuta̱ u na a ci yaꞋan boroji. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Shalum maku ma Haloshi, vuza kelime vu kagimi ka kapashi ko yoku ka Urushelima, ɗa u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Malakija n Hashubu a shamgbai. muku mu n kere n ni feu a̱ ɓa̱nka̱ yi ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wu ulinga wa. <verse eid="NEH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Hanun n aza a na a ida̱shi a Zanowa ele ɗa a lapulai Utsutsu u Ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱. Ɗa a maꞋasakai u ɗa, kpamu a̱ shikpai ukungulu u ni, ɗa a zuwai agbaguratsu n aburakpatsu a̱ iyum koɓolo ni ili i na ya kuka̱na̱ utsutsu wa. Ɗa kpamu a lapulai mashilya ma ugaɗi ka̱u ma na ma yawai udashi ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawantawun (1,500) ili na i gita̱i a̱ Utsutsu u Ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ali a kubana utsutsu u ka̱kiza̱. <verse eid="NEH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Malakija maku ma Rekabu, vuza na wi o tsugono tsu Betu-hakeremu, ɗa u lapulai Utsutsu u Ka̱kiza̱. Ɗa u maꞋasakai u ɗa. U zuwai ukungulu n ni n aburakpatsu n agbaguratsu a̱ Utsutsu wa. <verse eid="NEH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Shalum maku ma Kolo-hoze, vuza kelime vu kapashi ka Mizipa, ɗa u lapulai Utsutsu u ka̱shi ka̱ mini. Ɗa u maꞋasakai u ɗa, ali ɗa u palai u ɗa. Ɗa u ukai ni Utsutsu u ni, na̱ a̱ka̱na̱tsu a̱ ni aza a na a̱ ku ka̱na̱ Utsutsu wa. Ɗa kpamu u maꞋasakai mashilya ma kadaɓa ka Shela, a tsu ɗekushe ta̱ kaꞋa Siluwamu, vu kashina ko mogono, koɓolo n ka na ka walai a kubana a̱ likuci i Dawuda. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Nehemiya maku ma Azabuku, vuza kelime vu kapashi ka Betu-zuru, ɗa a̱yi feu u ka̱na̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Shalum u shamgbai. Ɗa u yaꞋin kulapulu ali a kasaun ka Dawuda, a uɓon u na a̱ ga̱va̱i kadaɓa, koɓolo n uɓon u na a maꞋin iꞋuwa ya aza gbagbain osoji.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aza e Levi a na a lapulai mashilya ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Na ɗa aza e Levi a na a̱ gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Nehemiya u shamgbai. Rehum maku ma Bani ɗa u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma. Ɗa Hashabiya vuza kelime vu kapashi ka Kayila u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Rehum u shamgbai. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Na ɗa aza e le a na a̱ ɓa̱nka̱i le kulapula mashilya ma, ele ɗa Bawai maku ma Henadadu, vuza kelime vu kapashi ka Kayila, u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Hashabiya u shamgbai. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Ezaru maku ma Jesuwa, vuza kelime vu kapashi ka Mizipa, u gita̱i kulapula uɓon u yoku u mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Bawai u shamgbai. Uɓon u nanlo u ɗaɗa u pasamgbanai e kelime ka̱ ubuta̱ u na a zuwai ucanuku u kuvon a uɓon u na mashilya ma mo kondorukpoi. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Baruku maku ma Zabayi, u gita̱i kulapula kapashi ko yoku n utsura u ka̱ɗu a̱ ubuta̱ u na Ezaru u shamgbai. Ɗa u lapulai ali a kubana a̱ utsutsu u kpaꞋa ku Eliyashibu Ganu vu gbayin. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Meremotu maku ma Uriya, vashi vu Hakozu, u gita̱i kulapula kapashi ko yoku ka mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Baruku u shamgbai, ali a kubana uteku u kpaꞋa ku Eliyashibu. <verse eid="NEH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Ɗa a nan Ganu a na uta̱i a uɓon u na wi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n Urushelima a̱ gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Meremotu u shamgbai. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Bayami koɓolo n Hashubu ɗa a maꞋin mashilya ma na mi a kinda kpaꞋa ku le, ɗa Azariya maku ma Masaya matsukaya ma Ananiya u lapulai uɓon u kpaꞋa ku ni. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Binuyi maku ma Henadadu u gita̱i kulapula uɓon u na Azariya u shamgbai ɗevu n kpaꞋa ku ni a̱ ubuta̱ u na mashilya ma mo kondorokpoi. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Palalu maku ma Uzayi u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a uɓon u na mashilya ma mo kondorokpoi n uɓon u na mashilya ma ugaɗi ma kpaꞋa ku mogono a ulanga wa aza a kindi. Ɗa Pedaya maku ma Paroshi u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Palalu u shamgbai. <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />Pedaya u yaꞋan ta̱ ulinga koɓolo n aza a na a ci yaꞋan ulinga wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin aza a na i a̱ ida̱shi a nsasan n Ofelu. Ɗa a lapulai mashilya ma ali a kubana a utsutsu gbayin u mini ma na mi a uɓon u kasana, kpamu n kumaꞋa ku ugaɗi ku na ki ɗevu n mashilya ma. <verse eid="NEH 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Ɗa aza a Tekowa a̱ gita̱i kulapula kapashi ko yoku ka mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Pedaya u shamgbai a uɓon kumaꞋa kugbayin ugaɗi ali a kubana a mashilya ma Kaginda ka Ofelu. <verse eid="NEH 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Ɗa anan ganu o yoku a lapulai mashilya ma na ma lazai a kubana a utsutsu wo odoku, ɗa yaba dem u lapulai mashilya ma na mi e kelime ku kpaꞋa ku ni. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Ɗa Zadoku maku ma Imeru u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na anan ganu a shamgbai. Ɗa u lapulai uɓon mashilya ma kpaꞋa ku ni. Shemaya maku ma Shikaniya, vuza kindi ku Utsutsu u Kasana, u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Zadoku u shamgbai. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Ɗa Hananiya maku ma Shelemiya n Hanun, maku ma̱ ta̱li ma Zalafu, a̱ gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a uɓon u na Shemaya u shamgbai. Meshulamu maku ma Berekiya u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a uɓon u na Hananiya n Hanun a shamgbai n ulinga. Ɗa u lapulai mashilya ma na mi e kelime ku kpaꞋa ku ni. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Malikiya, vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na a tsu yima azanariya, u gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a̱ ubuta̱ u na Meshulam u shamgbai. Ɗa u lapulai mashilya ma ali a kubana a kpaꞋa ka aza a ulinga wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin n aza a tsulaga, ma na mi a kinda utsutsu u kunu ku gaɗi ku na o tsu ɓolongu, ɗevu n kunu ku na ki a uɓon u na mashilya ma mo kondorokpoi. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Awakana a azanariya n aza a tsulaga tsa, a̱ gita̱i kulapula mashilya ma a uɓon u na Malikiya u shamgbai. Ɗa a lapulai mogon mu ukocishi ali a kubana uɓon wu tsutsu wu nkyon.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Tsurala adama a ulinga u kumaꞋa ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Ana Sanbalatu u panai a̱tsu aza a Yahuda ci gita̱ ta̱ kumaꞋasaka mashilya ma, ɗa u yaꞋin wupa ka̱u u zoꞋoshi tsu. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Ɗa kpamu u dansai e kelime ka aza a̱ ni n osoji a aza Samariya, u danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i uma a Yahuda aza a unambi wu utsura a nampa i a kuyaꞋan? Ene ta̱ i ta̱ a kufuɗa kumaꞋasaka mashilya ma n ka̱ci ke le? Ko i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan alyuka ɗa? I ca ni a kuciga kukotso ulinga wa kanna kete? Ko ene i ta̱ a kufuɗa o bonoko kaginga ka atali a na a̱ kula̱i va n wuma tsu na ishi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Ɗa Tobiya vuza vu Amona vuna wi kashani ɗevu n a̱yi u danai, &lt;&lt;Mashilya ma na i a kumaꞋa va mesheꞋe ma kakamba ma kumba baci maꞋa mi ta̱ a̱ kuyikpa̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Ɗa mpa Nehemiya n yaꞋin avasa n danai, pana tsu na o goyoi tsu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, yaꞋan ishikushi i na i a kuyaꞋanka tsu i bono a kaci ke le. Ka̱ta̱ a̱ pura̱ le a banka tsugbashi a iɗika i yoku ci ili i gbani i na a̱ pura̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u ku. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Ka̱ta̱ vu cinukpaka le unushi u na a yaꞋin ba, ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu takpaka le unushi u na a yaꞋankai nu ba, adama a na a shika tsu ta̱ a̱tsu a maꞋin. <verse eid="NEH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Ɗa tsu lyaꞋi kelime n kumaꞋa mashilya ma ali ma yawai kagimi ka ugaɗi ka̱ ni, tsu gasakai likuci ya ra̱ka̱, adama a na uma a yaꞋan ta̱ ulinga wa n a̱ɗu ra̱ka̱. <verse eid="NEH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Ama a na Sanbalatu n Tobiya n aza Arabiya n Amona n Ashidodu a panai ulinga u kulapulu ku mashilya ma Urushelima ma wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime, kpamu uɓon una a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i va u ɗa u yaꞋan ta̱ u lapuli, ɗa a yaꞋin wupa ka̱u. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Ɗa ra̱ka̱ vu le a gbaɓai kaci adama a na a bana a yaꞋan kuvon n aza Urushelima, ka̱ta̱ a̱ tuka̱ nu nripula̱. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Ama ɗa ci yaꞋin kavasa u Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, ɗa tsu zuwai aza a kindi inda le kanna n kayin.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Ɗa aza a Yahuda a danai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">&lt;&lt;Utsura wa aza a ulinga wa wi ta̱ a̱ kugusa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 4:10">kaginga ka atali n kayala ka buwa ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 4:10">Nini ɗai tsa kufuɗa kumaꞋa mashilya ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Ɗa Irala i tsu i danai, &lt;&lt;Kafu e yeve i na i lo ko ene tsu, ci ta̱ a kuꞋuwa wu e le tsu una le, ka̱ta̱ tsu shamgbatangu ulinga u kumaꞋa wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Ama makyan n a̱bunda̱i aza a Yahuda a na i a̱ ida̱shi ɗevu n irala i tsu, a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ n a danai kusheshe ku na irala i tsu i a yaꞋanka tsu. <verse eid="NEH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Ta n zuwai uma a o foɓuso nannai, n peciki le tsu na i a kumaci ku le a̱ ubuta̱ u na ka̱ta̱ o kotso kumaꞋa mashilya ma ba. Uɓa̱ni n ucanuku u kuvon u le otokobi n ayaꞋa nu njiki. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Ana menei tsu na kakuna ka ki, ɗa n ɗa̱nga̱i n ɓolongi aza gbagbain n nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n aza a na a buwai n danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i pana wovon wi irala i tsu ba. Ciɓai Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ n tsugbayin kpamu ili i wovon, yaꞋin kuvon adama a̱ muku n ɗa̱ olobo nu nkere n ɗa̱ n a̱ma̱ci a̱ ɗa̱, n iꞋuwa i ɗa̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Ana irala i tsu a̱ ciya̱i kuyeve tsu yeve ta̱ kusheshe ku le, ɗa kpamu Ka̱shile ka̱ sa̱nka̱i le kushatangu kusheshe ku le. Ɗa ra̱ka̱ vu tsu tsu bonoi a̱ ubuta̱ u maꞋasaka mashilya ma. <verse eid="NEH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Ili i na i ɗikai a kanna ka nanlo, aza o yoku a kuyaꞋan ulinga u kumaꞋa mashilya ma aza o yoku tamkpamu uɓa̱ni n ucanuku u kuvon, nsara n nra̱ga̱ nu njiki nu ntogu mi iyim. Ɗa aza kelime e peciki ka̱ci ke le a shamgbai a̱ ka̱ca̱pa̱ ka aza a Yahuda. <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />Aza a na i a kumaꞋa mashilya ma n aza a na i a kuɗika ucanuku a̱ ka̱na̱i kuɗika u ɗa n kukiye ku te, kukiye ku te tankpamu uɓa̱ni n ucanuku u kuvon. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />KamaꞋi dem ki ta̱ u woki n kotokobi ka̱ ni a makyan ma na wi a kumaꞋa. Ama vuza na wa̱ kulika̱ kavana wi ta̱ ɗevu nu mpa. <verse eid="NEH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Ɗa n danai nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n aza a gbagbain n uma a na a buwai, n danai, &lt;&lt;Ulinga wa u gbayin u ɗa, kpamu u ɗa wi ta̱ u pecekushi, a̱tsu feu cita̱ upecekushi dadaꞋin n vu toku a̱ ubuta̱ u kumaꞋa mashilya ma. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Ɗa baci i panai ciliki tsu kavana, ka̱ta̱ i ɓolongu ɗe a̱ ubuta̱ wa, Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ki ta̱ a kuyaꞋan vishili adama a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Ta ci lyaꞋi kelime n kuyaꞋan ulinga u kumaꞋa wa nannai a kanna lakam n usana ali ubuta̱ u yimba̱na̱, kagimi ka̱ tsu a ulinga u mashilya, kagimi ka̱ tsu ko yoku tankpamu uɓa̱ni nu nsara. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />A makyan ma nanlo n dana ta̱ uma a, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan vuma dem koɓolo n ka̱ɓa̱nki ka̱ ulinga ka̱ ni a̱ da̱sa̱ngu a Urushelima, adama a na a̱ la̱na̱ likuci ya n kayin, ka̱ta̱ kpamu a yaꞋan ulinga n kana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Adama nannai mpa ko aza a̱ va̱, ko agbashi a̱ va̱, n aza a kinda a na i koɓolo nu mpa, babu vuza na u foɗoi motogu ma̱ ni. Yaba dem uɓa̱ni n ucanuku u kuvon u ni.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya u ɓa̱nka̱i aza a unambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />A na i lo ɗa uma o yoku a̱ma̱ci n ali, a̱ ka̱na̱i kuyaꞋanka aza e le aza a Yahuda mololo. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Adama a na aza o yoku a dana ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱tsu n muku n tsu olobo nu nkere ci ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i, ci ta̱ a kuciga ilikulyaꞋa i na tsa kulyaꞋa adama a na tsu ciya̱ wuma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Ɗa kpamu aza o yoku a danai, &lt;&lt;Tsu neke ta̱ ashina a̱ tsu, n ashina a itacishi, n iꞋuwa i tsa aguta, adama a na tsu ciya̱ ili kulyaꞋa ta lo tsa̱ ku kuwa̱ n kambulu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Aza o yoku kpamu a dana ta̱, &lt;&lt;Tsu kopuku ta̱ ikebe adama a na tsu tsupa mogono utafu wa ashina a̱ tsu n ashina a itacishi a̱ tsu. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />A̱ tsu ta na vuza ɗa n vutoku mpasa n te. Muku n tsu nu n le ili i te i ɗa. N nannai dem ɗa a zuwai tsu tsu zuwa muku n tsu olobo nu nkere n tsu okpo agbashi. Muku mu n kere n tsu n yoku e denge le ta̱ ɗe ɗa okpoi agbashi, ama ci n utsura u na ci yaꞋan ili i yoku ba, adama a na isa ta̱ ashina n ashina a itacishi a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Ana mpa Nehemiya n panai mololo ma n kadanshi ka, ɗa n na̱mgba̱i ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱u. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Ana n sheshei a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱va̱, ɗa n nekei aza a gbagbaꞋin nu nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ unushi. Ɗa n danai le, &lt;&lt;Yi ta̱ o kuɗoro aza a̱ ɗa̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wa okopu ana yi e kunekeshe le, ali ɗa yi a ku isa i pasatangu i na i nekei le,&gt;&gt; Ɗa n ɓolongi ka̱bunda̱i ka uma adama a kakuna ka. <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />Ɗa n danai le, &lt;&lt;Ci yaꞋan ta̱ tsu na tsa kufuɗa adama a na ci shiba̱ aza a̱ tsu aza a Yahuda a na e dengei wa aza a na i aza a Yahuda ba. Ama ali n gogo na yi ta̱ e kudenge aza a̱ ɗa̱, ali kuyain kuɗai tsa ku tsulasaka le?&gt;&gt; Ɗa a paɗai bini, adama a na a̱ ciya̱ ili i kudansa ba. <verse eid="NEH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Ɗa n danai le, &lt;&lt;Ili i na yi a kuyaꞋan i ɗa i gaꞋan ba. U gaꞋan ta̱ i yongo n wovon u Ka̱shile, adama a na ka̱ta̱ irala i tsu ele na i aza a Yahuda ba, a̱ ciya̱ i na a kuyaꞋanka tsu ma̱ka̱n ba. <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Mpa n aza a̱ va̱ n agbashi a̱ va̱ feu ci ta̱ e kunekeshe uma okopu ikebe n ilikulyaꞋa. Ama gogo na yaꞋan tsu ka̱sukpa̱ kuneke kutan n ci isai tsu pasatangu i na tsu nekei. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Anana i bonoko le ashina e le n ashina itacishi e le n ashina a nɗanga n Zaitu n le n iꞋuwa i le n ili i na yi isai i pasatangi va dem, ugboku u te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka amangatawun a ikebe n ilikulyaꞋa n ma̱kya̱n, n maꞋin ma zaitu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Ɗa aza e kelime a ushuki a danai, &lt;&lt;Ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan tsu na vu dansai. Ci ta̱ o kubonoko le n ucanuku le, ci kpamu o kudoku ku isa ili i yoku we le ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa n ɗekushei anan Ganu ɗa n zuwai nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ a kucuna e kelime ke le ka anan ganu a dana i ta̱ a kushatangu i na a dansai. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Ɗa n za̱ka̱tsa̱i motogu ma̱ va̱ ɗa n danai, &lt;&lt;Tsu nampa tsu ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ za̱ka̱tsa̱ vuza na baci u kpa̱ɗa̱i kushatangu uzuwakpani u ni. YaꞋan kpamu Ka̱shile ka̱ pura̱ngu ili kpaꞋa ku ni ra̱ka̱, ka̱ta̱ kpamu u ka̱sukpa̱ babu i li.&gt;&gt; Ɗa ka̱bunda̱i ka uma kana ko ɓolongi va kucukpai ka danai, &lt;&lt;Wokpo nannai&gt;&gt; Ɗa a cikpai Vuzavaguɗu. Ɗa aza gbagbain a shatangi uzuwakpani u na a yaꞋin. <verse eid="NEH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Ko n tsu nannai, makyan ma na a zuwai mu Gomuna a̱ likuci i Yahuda, a̱ya̱ kupa n e re a na a lazai, a̱ ka̱ya̱ kamanga ko tsugono tsu mogono Atazesu, ali a kubana a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamangankupa n e re, mpa ko tana aza a̱ va̱ babu vuza na wi isai ilikulyaꞋa tsu mogono. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Anan Gomuna a na a lyaꞋi tsugono kafu mpa a takacika ta̱ uma ka̱u a̱ ubuta̱ u ku isa ilikulyaꞋa n ma̱kya̱n we le, babu biꞋi ikebe ya azurufa amangere. Ali olobo aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka le ulinga a kuyaꞋanka uma a̱ra̱ɗi. Ama mpa n yaꞋan tsu le ba, adama a na mpa mi ta̱ a kupana wovon u Ka̱shile. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Adama a nannai ɗa n nekei utsura u va̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kumaꞋasaka mashilya ma. Ɗa olobo a na i a kuyaꞋanka mu ulinga a gbaɓai kaci adama a ulinga u kumaꞋa ka, ra̱ka̱ vu tsu tsu tsula ashina ba. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Ko n nannai aza a Yahuda nu nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ele uma amangatawun n amangerenkupa (150) ɗa a lyaꞋi koɓolo nu mpa, babu biꞋi uma a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i wa̱ a̱tsu aza a na a̱ ida̱shi u ka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱tsu. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Tsu nampa tsu ɗa a ci yaꞋanka mu ilikulyaꞋa a kana lakam. A tsu kiɗa ta̱ kanaka kete n nlala n ta̱li n na mi n tsuloboi, nu ntoku n a̱bunda̱i, a kanna dem a̱ tsu tuka̱ ta̱ edele a̱ ma̱kya̱n ma savu. Ama ko n tsu nannai mi isa ilikulyaꞋa tsu gomuna ba, adama a na uma i ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ katakaci n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ciɓa vu yaꞋanka mu kasingai adama ili i na n yaꞋankai uma a nampa a.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">A lyaꞋi kelime n tsurala adama a ulinga u kumaꞋa ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Ana i lo ɗa Sanbalatu n Tobiya koɓolo n Geshem vuza vu Araba n irala i tsu i na i buwai a panai tsu kotso ta̱ kumaꞋasaka mashilya ma ɗa kpamu tsu maꞋi ubuta̱ u na ishi a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i. Ko an wo okpoi ka̱ta̱ tsu shikpa̱ a̱ɓa̱ya̱ntsu ba, <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />ɗa Sanbalatu n Geshem a̱ suꞋuki mu n akaka, a danai, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ tsu gasa a̱ likuci i kenu i yoku e Keteshe ko Ono.&gt;&gt; Ama i ta̱ e kusheshe adama a na a̱ ciya̱ a takacika mu. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Ɗa n suki aza a usuki a bana dana le. &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ pa ulinga ma̱ kuciya̱ ku bana ɗe ba. Adama a yiɗa̱i ma̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ ulinga u gbayin va̱ n gida̱la̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ɗa̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i kusuꞋuku mu n akaka e te e te ali kuna̱shi mpa kpamu nu n danai le kadanshi kete kete. <verse eid="NEH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Akaka a tawun a ɗa Sanbalatu u suki kagbashi ka̱ ni n katagarda ka akaka ka uɓa̱yuwi n kadanshi kete kete. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />Ili i na a ɗanai punu a katagarda ka i ɗaɗa. &lt;&lt;Tsu ciya̱ ta̱ arabali a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a na i a ida̱shi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱tsu a danai avu n aza a Yahuda yi ta̱ e kusheshe kugbanigbani. I ɗaɗa i zuwai ɗa yi a kumaꞋa mashilya ma, kpamu Geshem feu u dana tsu ta̱ mayu ɗa. Na lo ɗa koci ba tsu pana ta̱ kpamu vu danai vi ciga ta̱ vu okpo mogono me le. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Ali vu zuwai eneki a sala adama a̱ nu a Urushelima, ka̱ta̱ a dana mogono mi ta̱ lo a Yahuda. Mayu mogono Atazesu wi ta̱ a kupana arabali a nampa a, ɗaɗa i zuwai n danai u ku gaꞋan ta̱ mpa n avu tsu gasa tsu dansa ukuna u nampa wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Ɗa m bonokoi Sanbalatu n akaka a n danai, &lt;&lt;Ukuna u nanlo mayu ɗa ba, avu ɗa vu sheshei ka nanlo ra̱ka̱ a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Ra̱ka̱ vu le a ciga ta̱ e neke tsu wovon ɗa, i ta̱ e kene a danshi ikyamba i tsu yi ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱ ka̱ta̱ tsu ka̱sukpa̱ ulinga u kumaꞋa wa. Ɗa n yaꞋin kavasa n danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱shile, neke mu utsura u ka̱ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Ɗa kanna kete m banai adama a na me ene Shemaya maku ma Delaya vashi vu Mehetabelu vuza na wi uɓa̱ya̱ngi a kpaꞋa ku ni ba. Ɗa u danai mu, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan tsu bana tsu sheɗeku A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ Ka̱shile, a̱ ubuta̱ u ciɗa wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a, ka̱ta̱ tsu ɓa̱ya̱ngu utsutsu, adama a na i ta̱ lo a̱ kuta̱wa̱ ku una wu, i ta̱ a kufuɗa kuta̱wa̱ ku una wu n kayin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Ɗa mu ushuki n danai, &lt;&lt;Mpa vuma tsu va̱ ɗa n kusuma? Vuma tsu va̱ ɗa u kuꞋuwa a̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin adama a na u laꞋaka? Ko ubuta̱ mi a kubana ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Ana n sheshei, ɗa n yevei Ka̱shile ka yaꞋan kadanshi n Shemaya ba, ama Tobiya n Sanbalatu e neke yi ta̱ ikebe adama a na u yaꞋanka mu kene ku nampa. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />A tsupa yi ta̱ adama a na u neke mu wovon n yaꞋan u nushi a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan ili i na a dansai, tsu nanlo tsu ɗa a̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ mu kula adama a na a̱ ciya̱ ili yi ishikushi. <verse eid="NEH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Ɗa n yaꞋin kavasa n danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ciɓa n kagbanigbani ka na Tobiya n Sanbalatu a yaꞋankai tsu. ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu ciɓa n keneki ka vuka Nowadiya n eneki a na a buwai ra̱ka̱ a cigai kuneke mu wovon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukocishi u kumaꞋa ku mashilya ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka ayin amangerenkupa n e re a ɗa o kotsoi ulinga u kumaꞋa mashilya ma a kanna ka kamanga n a tawun o wotoi u Elu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Elu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wotoi u Elu wa aza a Babila ɗaɗa wotoi u ta̱li wa aza a Yahuda. Na ɗa a ukocishi u wotoi u kunla̱i n wotoi u kuci</char></note>. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Ana irala i tsu n uma a na i a̱ ida̱shi u ka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱tsu a panai, ɗa wovon u ka̱na̱i le ikyamba i le i kuwa̱i. Adama a na e yeve ta̱ ulinga wa n utsura u Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu kaꞋa ci yaꞋin u ɗa. <verse eid="NEH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka ayin a nanlo a aza a gbagbain a Yahuda a̱ ka̱na̱i kuɗanaka Tobiya atagarda akaka, a̱yi feu n u ɗanakai le. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Adama a na uma n a̱bunda̱i a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a Yahuda a kucuna ta̱ i ta̱ a̱ kuɓanka̱ Tobiya, adama a na a̱yi kototo ka Shekaniya kolobo ka Ara kaꞋa vuza vu Yahuda. Ko n nannai ba, Jehohanan maku ma Tobiya u zuwa ta̱ mekere ma Meshulam kolobo ka Berekiya. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Ɗa uma a a̱ ka̱na̱i kudana mu ukuna wu usuɓi u Tobiya, kpamu o tsu bonoko yi ta̱ ili ra̱ka̱ i na mpa n dansai. Ɗa tana u ka̱na̱i ku suꞋuku mu n akaka adama a na mpa n pana wovon.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Ana o kotsoi kumaꞋa mashilya ma, ɗa a̱ shikpa̱i ukungulu a̱ utsutsu wa ra̱ka̱, ɗa a zuwai aza a kinda ku utsutsu wa n aza a ishipa n aza e Levi. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Ɗa n zuwai aza a̱ va̱ a̱ la̱na̱ likuci i Urushelima, Hanani n Hananiya vuza vu kelime vu kula̱na̱ mashilya, adama a na Hananiya u laꞋa ta̱ aza a na a buwai usuɓi n wovon u Ka̱shile. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Ɗa n danai le ka̱ta̱ a̱ ɓa̱yuwa̱ utsutsu u Urushelima wa n usana ba ali kana ka̱ uta̱. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu a gbagura u ɗa kafu aza a na i a kinda utsutsu wa a laza n kulivi. A̱ la̱nsa̱ aza a kindi a Urushelima ka̱ta̱ a zuwa le a̱ ubuta̱ u na u yotsoi, aza o yoku tankpamu a kinda mashilya ma a uɓon wu iꞋuwa i le.<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka̱bunda̱i ka agbashi a na o bonoi r (Ezira 2:1-70)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Likuci i Urushelima yi ta̱ n wanshi nu mgbayin ka̱u, ama aza a na i a ida̱shi punu i n a̱bunda̱i ba, kpamu ka̱ta̱ a maꞋa iꞋuwa ka̱u ba. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱va̱ ka danai mu n ɓolongu uma nu nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n uma a na a buwai adama a na a ɗana ula e le tsu na i a kumaci ku le. Ɗa n ciya̱i katagarda ka tsumani ka na a ɗanai ula aza na a̱ gita̱i kubono a ubuta̱ u tsugbashi. I na n cinai punu i ɗa na.<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Nava ɗaɗa uma a na o bonoi n ubuta̱ wu ugbashi aza a na Nebukanezaru mogono ma Babila u pura̱i a kubana ugbashi. Ɗa o bonoi a iɗika i Urushelima n iɗika i Yahuda, yaba dem u bonoi a̱ likuci i ni. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Aza e kelime a ele ɗa Zerubabelu n Jesuwa n Nehemiya n Seraya n RaꞋamiya n Nahamani n Modikaya n Bilishan n Misaferetu n Bigawai n Nehum, koɓolo m BaꞋanahu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Nava ɗaɗa ula aza a Isaraila a na o bonoi n ugbashi n ka̱bunda̱i ke le.<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Ntsukaya m Paroshi, ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n ere n amangatatsukupa n ere (2,172.)<verse eid="NEH 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Ntsukaya n Shefatiya, ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n amangatatsukupa n e re, (372).<verse eid="NEH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Ntsukaya n Ara, ele uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n amangerenkupa n e re (652).<verse eid="NEH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Ntsukaya n Pahatu-mowabu, a kumaci ku Jesuwa n Jowabu, ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n e re n amangatawunkunla̱i n kupa n kunla̱i (2,818).<verse eid="NEH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Ntsukaya n Elam ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawenre n amangerenkupa n a̱na̱shi (1,254).<verse eid="NEH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Ntsukaya n Zatu, ele ɗa uma amangatawunkunla̱i n amangere n a tawun, (845).<verse eid="NEH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Ntsukaya n Zakai, ele ɗa uma amangatawencindere n amangatatsu (760).<verse eid="NEH 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Ntsukaya m Binuyi ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n amangere n kunla̱i (648).<verse eid="NEH 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Ntsukaya m Bebayi, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n kamanga n kunla̱i (628).<verse eid="NEH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Ntsukaya n Azagada, ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n e re n amangatawantatsu n kamanga n e re (2,322),<verse eid="NEH 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Ntsukaya n Adonikam, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n amangatatsu n e cindere (667).<verse eid="NEH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Ntsukaya m Bigawai, ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n e re n amangatatsu n e cindere (2,067).<verse eid="NEH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Ntsukaya n Adini, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n amangerenkupa n a tawun (655).<verse eid="NEH 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Ntsukaya n Ataru nu ntsukaya n Hezekaya ele ɗa uma amanga̱na̱shinkupa n kunla̱i.<verse eid="NEH 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Ntsukaya n Hashum, ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n kamanga n kunla̱i (328).<verse eid="NEH 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Ntsukaya m Bezayi, ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n kamanga n a̱na̱shi (324).<verse eid="NEH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Ntsukaya n Harifa, ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kupa n e re (112).<verse eid="NEH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Ntsukaya n Gibiyon, ele ɗa uma amanga̱na̱shinkupa n a tawun.<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Na ɗa uma a na ikaya i le i da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci-likuci i nampa ele feu o bonoi ta̱.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:26">Batalami n Netofa, ele ɗa uma amangatawun n amanga̱na̱shi n kunla̱i (188).<verse eid="NEH 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Aza a Anatotu, ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamanga n kunla̱i (128).<verse eid="NEH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Aza a Betu-azamavetu, ele ɗa uma amangere n e re.<verse eid="NEH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Aza a Kiriyatu-jerim n Kepira m Beyerotu, ele ɗa uma amangatawencindere n amangere n a tatsu (743).<verse eid="NEH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Aza a Rama n Geba, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n kamanga n ke te (621).<verse eid="NEH 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Aza a Mikamashi, ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamanga n e re (122).<verse eid="NEH 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Aza a Betelu n Ai, ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamanga n a tatsu (123).<verse eid="NEH 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Aza a Nebo, ele ɗa uma amangerenkupa n e re.<verse eid="NEH 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Aza a Elam o yoku, ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawenre n amangerenkupa n a̱na̱shi (1,254).<verse eid="NEH 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Aza a Harim, ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n kamanga, (320).<verse eid="NEH 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Aza a Jeriko, ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n amangere n a tawun (345).<verse eid="NEH 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Aza a Lodu n Hadida n Ono, ele ɗa uma amangatawencindere n kamanga n kete, (721).<verse eid="NEH 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Aza a SenaꞋaha, ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n a tatsu n amangatawunkuci n kamangankupa (3,930).<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Na ɗa ula a kumaci ku anan Ganu a na o bonoi n ugbashi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:39" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:39">Ntsukaya n Jedaya vu kpaꞋa ku Jesuwa, ele ɗa uma amangatawunkuci n amangatatsunkupa n a tatsu (973).<verse eid="NEH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Ntsukaya n Imeru, ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangerenkupa n e re (1,052).<verse eid="NEH 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Ntsukaya n Pashuru, ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawenre n amangere n e cindere (1,247).<verse eid="NEH 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Ntsukaya n Harim, ele ɗa uma ka̱kpa̱n n kupa n e cindere (1,017).<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Na ɗa ula a kumaci ka aza e Levi a na o bonoi n ugbashi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:43" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:43">Ntsukaya n Jesuwa, n Kadimiyelu vu kpaꞋa ku Hodeva, ele ɗa uma amangatatsunkupa n a̱na̱shi.<verse eid="NEH 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Aza a ishipa A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:44" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:44">ele ɗa ntsukaya n Asafa, i ta̱ uma amangatawun n amangere n kunla̱i, (148).<verse eid="NEH 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Aza a̱ kula̱na̱ utsutsu tankpamu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:45" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:45">ntsukaya n Shalum nu ntsukaya n Ateru nu n Talumon nu n Akubu nu ntsukaya n Hatita nu n Shobayi, ele ɗa uma amangatawun n kamangankupa n kunla̱i, (138).<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Na ɗa ula aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ulinga A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:46" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:46">Ntsukaya n Ziha nu n Hasufa nu n Tabuwatu,<verse eid="NEH 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />nu n Kerosu nu n Siya nu n Padon,<verse eid="NEH 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />nu n Lebana nu n Hagaba nu n Shalumayi,<verse eid="NEH 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />nu n Hanan nu n Gidelu nu n Gaharu,<verse eid="NEH 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />nu n Reyiya nu n Rezin nu n Nekoda,<verse eid="NEH 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />nu n Gazamu nu n Uza nu n Pasiya,<verse eid="NEH 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />nu n Besayi nu n MeꞋunimu nu n Nefushesim,<verse eid="NEH 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />nu n Babuku nu n Hakufa nu n Harihuru,<verse eid="NEH 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />nu n Bazilatu nu n Mehida nu n Harisha,<verse eid="NEH 7:54" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />nu n Barakosu nu n Sisera nu n Tema,<verse eid="NEH 7:55" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />nu n Neziya nu n Hatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Na ɗa ula aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka Sulemanu ulinga aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:57" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:57">ele ɗa ntsukaya n Sotayi nu n Soferetu nu n Perida,<verse eid="NEH 7:57" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />nu n JaꞋala nu n Darukon nu n Gidelu,<verse eid="NEH 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />nu n Shefatiya nu n Hatilu nu n Pokeretu-hazebayim nu n Amon.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Ntsukaya ma aza a ulinga wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin nu n ma aza a na i a kuyaꞋanka Sulemanu ulinga ra̱ka̱ aza a na o bonoi n ugbashi. Ele ɗa uma amangatawantatsu n amanga̱na̱shinkupa n e re (392).<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Na ɗa ula aza a na uta̱i a̱ likuci i Telu-mela n Telu-haresha nu n Kerebu n likuci i Adon n Imeru, ama a fuɗa e yeve kumaci ku le ko iꞋuwa yi ikaya i le ko ele aza a Isaraila ɗa ba.<verse eid="NEH 7:61" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Ntsukaya n Delaya nu n Tobiya nu n Nekoda, ele ɗa uma amangatawa̱nta̱li n amangere n e re (642).<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Na ɗa ula anan Ganu a na o bonoi a Urushelima,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:63" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:63">ntsukaya n Hobaya nu n Hakoza nu n Barizilayi. A̱yi Barizilayi vu nampa a̱yi ɗa u zuwai mekere ma Barizilayi vuza vu Giliyadu, ɗa u ɗikai kula ka akaya a̱ ni.<verse eid="NEH 7:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Uma a nampa a a̱ la̱nsa̱i ula ele a katagarda ka tsumani ka ikaya i le, ama a̱ ciya̱ ula ele ba. Adama a nannai ɗa bonokoi le aza a unata, ɗa utukai le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka anan Ganu. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Ɗa gomuna vi iɗika ya u danai le i a kulyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa i ciɗa i na e nekei Ka̱shile alyuka ba, sai Ganu u yaꞋan ulinga n Yurim n Tumi u la̱nsa̱ kuyeve ku Vuzavaguɗu adama a kakuna ka nanlo.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Ka̱bunda̱i ka uma ka na ko bonoi a iɗika i Yahuda, babu biꞋi agbashi e le, i ta̱ uma a̱kpa̱n amangere n e re n amangatawantatsu n amangatatsu (42,360),<verse eid="NEH 7:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Agbashi e le ali n a̱ma̱ci, ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n e cindire n amangatawantatsu n kamangankupa n e cindere (7,337).</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:67">Aza a ishipa ali n a̱ma̱ci, ele ɗa uma amangatawenre n amangere n a tawun (245).<verse eid="NEH 7:67" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Odoku e le amangatawencindere n kamangankupa n a̱ta̱li, (736)</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:68">mkparagi tamkpamu amangatawenre n amangere n a tawun (245),<verse eid="NEH 7:68" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />Arakuma ele amangatawa̱na̱shi n kamangankupa n tawun (435) nu njaki a̱kpa̱n a̱ta̱li n amangatawencindere n kamanga (6,720). <verse eid="NEH 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Aza e kelime a iꞋuwa yi ikaya i le o yoku e nekei kuneꞋen adama a ulinga wa. Gomuna u nekei azanariya kilo kunla̱i, n akpanu amangerenkupa, nu ntogu n tsuganu amangatawantawun n kamangankupa, (530). <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Aza e kelime ka ikaya i le e nekei azanariya amangatawun n amangatatsu n kunla̱i (168), azurufa ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawa̱na̱shi n amangerenkupa n kula̱i (1,458). <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Uma a na a buwai e nekei kuneꞋe ka azanariya amangatawun n amangatatsu n kunla̱i (168), azurufa kpamu kilo ka̱kpa̱n amangatawantatsu n kamanga n a tawun (1,325), koɓolo kpamu nu ntogu n tsuganu amangatatsu n cindere. <verse eid="NEH 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Anan Ganu n aza e levi n aza a na i a kinda utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a Vuzavaguɗu n aza a ishipa n aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ulinga a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu, n uma o yoku, n aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ o bonoi a̱ likuci i na ikaya i le i da̱sa̱ngi. Kafu wotoi u cindere u yawa cina ɗe aza a Isaraila a a̱ da̱sa̱ngu a̱ likuci i le.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ezira u kecekei uma wila̱ u Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />A kanna ka iyain ko wotoi u cindere ɗa uma a Isaraila o ɓolongi a Urushelima a̱ ka̱ba̱nga̱ ka na ki e kelime ka Utsutsu u mini. Ɗa a danai Ezira u tuka̱ le n katagarda ko kuyotsongusu ku Musa, ka na Vuzavaguɗu u nekei uma a Isaraila. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />A kanna ka nanlo kaꞋa Ezira ganu u tuka̱i katagarda ka̱ uka̱ta̱li ka̱ wila̱ ka a̱ ubuta̱ u koɓolo ka uma. Ali n a̱ma̱ci n aza a na a kufuɗa kupana e yeve ili i na ki a kadanshi. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Ɗa u shamgbai a̱ ka̱ba̱nga̱ ka na ki e kelime ka̱ Utsutsu u mini. Ili i na i ɗikai a makyan mu usana ali a kubana kanna a kaci, u ka̱na̱i ku keceke le wila̱ wa e kelime ka ali n a̱ma̱ci n aza a na a kufuɗa kupana e yeve ili i na ki a kadanshi. Ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ a zuwai atsuvu a kupana kuyotsongusu ku Musa ka. <verse eid="NEH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Ezira kaɗani u shamgbai gaɗi vu kirukpa ku na a yaꞋin adama a ka nanlo ka. Uma a na a shamgbai a uɓon kukiye ku singai ku ni ele ɗa, Matitiya n Shema n Anaya n Uriya n Hilikiya, koɓolo n MaꞋaseya. Ele na tamkpamu a shamgbai e kukiye ku gula̱ ku ni ele ɗa, Pedaya n Mishayel n Malikiya n Hashumu n Hashabadana n Zakariya koɓolo n Meshulamu. <verse eid="NEH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Ɗa Ezira u ɓa̱yuwa̱i katagarda ka̱ uka̱ta̱li ka e kelime ka uma ra̱ka̱, adama a na wi ta̱ gaɗi vu kirukpa ana u ɓa̱yuwa̱i katagarda ka, ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i kashani. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Ɗa Ezira u cikpai Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile vuzagbayin, &lt;&lt;Ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ ushuki a danai Tanannai! Tanannai.&gt;&gt;A̱ ɗa̱ngusa̱i ekiye ele gaɗi ɗa a̱ za̱lika̱i aci ele ali a iɗika, ɗa a cikpai Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="NEH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Ɗa aza e Levi a danai uma a ili i na kuyotsongusu ku Musa ka ki a kadanshi a makyan ma na i kashani, aza e Levi a ele ɗa, Jesuwa m Bani n Sherebeya n Jamin n Akubu n Shabetai n Hodiya n MaꞋaseya n Kelita n Azariya n Jozabadu n Hanan n Pelaya. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Ɗa e kecei katagarda ka kuyotsongusu ku Ka̱shile ka, na dansai ili i na yi punu tsu na yaba dem u kufuɗa kuyeve. <verse eid="NEH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Ana uma a panai ili na wila̱ wa wi a kudansa, ɗa ra̱ka̱ vu le a̱ ka̱na̱i ma̱shi. Ɗa Nehemiya vuza na wi Gomuna n Ezira Ganu kaɗani n aza e Levi a na i o kutonuko uma ili i na wila̱ wa wi a kudansa, a danai, &lt;&lt;Kanna ka nampa kanna ka ciɗa ka Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱ kaꞋa, u gaꞋan i na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko i shika̱ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Ɗa Nehemiya u danai le,&lt;&lt;Bonoi a iꞋuwa, i lyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa i singai ka̱ta̱ i soꞋo ili na yi nu uyoꞋo. Ka̱ta̱ i suꞋuku aza na i n ili ba, adama a na kanna ka nampa ka kanna ka ciɗa ka Vuzavaguɗu kaꞋa. Adama a nanai ka̱ta̱ i na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ba, adama a na ma̱za̱nga̱ ma na yi n maꞋa u Vuzavaguɗu ɗaɗa utsura u ɗa̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Ɗa aza e Levi a̱ ka̱na̱i kutono uma a n a kparasai le n danai, &lt;&lt;VaꞋanki n a̱ɗu a̱ ɗa̱, adama a na anana kanna ka ciɗa kaꞋa ka na a zagbai, ka̱ta̱ i na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ o bonosoi a iꞋuwa i le a lyaꞋi o soꞋi, ɗa kpamu a̱ ka̱na̱i ku pecukusu uma ilikulya wa aza a na i ni li ba, adama a na gogo na e yeve ta̱ i na e kecekei le. <verse eid="NEH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />A kanna ke ire ko wotoi ka, ɗa aza e kelime a iꞋuwa dem n anan Ganu n aza e Levi, ɗa o ɓolongi a̱ ubuta̱ u Ezira kaɗani adama a na u yotsongusu le wila̱ u Musa. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Ɗa a cinai a ɗanai punu a̱ wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu u na u nekei Musa, u danai aza a Isaraila i ta̱ o kuyongo a̱pa̱m a makyan ma̱ ka̱ɗiva̱ ko wotoi u cindere. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />A̱ ka̱na̱ kusala ukuna u wila̱ wa ra̱ka̱ punu a Urushelima n likuci i le ra̱ka̱, &lt;&lt;Banai gaɗi vu nsasan i tuka̱ n acaka a nɗanga n Zaitu n a nɗanga n Zaitu n kakamba n a nɗanga n Muritilu n a nɗanga ma̱ nshuwa n a nɗanga n na mi n a̱vuku adama a na i yaꞋanka ka̱ɗiva̱ ka na a ɗanai o kuyotsongusu ku Musa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Ɗa uma a banai a̱ la̱nsa̱i acaka a nɗanga ɗa a yaꞋankai ka̱ci ke le a̱pa̱m, yaba dem a gaɗi vu kukpa̱Ꞌa̱ ku kpaꞋa ku ni, n ulanga wu iꞋuwa i le n ulanga u kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile n ulanga u na wi e kelime n Utsutsu u mini n ulanga u na wi uɓon wu utsutsu u Ifirayimu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Aza a na o bonoi n ubuta̱ u tsugbashi feu a yaꞋankai ka̱ci ke le a̱pa̱m a na a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu punu. Ili i na i ɗikai a makyan ma Jesuwa maku ma Nun ali a kubana a kanna ka nanlo aza a Isaraila a sawa kuyaꞋan ka̱ɗiva̱ n ma̱za̱nga̱ tsu nanlo ba, ɗa uma a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱ ka̱u. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Kanna lakam Ezra utsu kece ta̱ a katagarda ka̱ wila̱ u Ka̱shile wa, a kanna ka ugiti ka̱ ka̱ɗiva̱ ka ali a kubana a kanna ka ukocishi. A yaꞋin ta̱ ka̱ɗiva̱ ka ali ayin e cindere a kanna ka̱ kula̱i ɗa a yaꞋin ka̱ɗiva̱ ka kuɓa̱ya̱ngu, tsu na wila̱ wa u dansai.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Uma a̱ shika̱i unushi u le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />A kanna ka kamanga n ka̱na̱shi ko wotoi u cindere wa, aza a Isaraila o ɓolongi a yaꞋin kakuli ɗa a ukai akashi o ntogu, a̱ tsungi kokomo aci e le. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Ɗa aza a Isaraila e pecei ka̱ci ka̱ le kau n omoci a, ɗa a̱ shika̱i unushi u le n unushi wi ikaya i le. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Ele lo kashani a̱ ubuta̱ u na i, ɗa a yaꞋin iyim i tatsu e kukece ke le katagarda ka̱ wila̱ ka Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le. Ɗa kpamu a yaꞋin iyim i tatsu ele a̱ kushika̱ unushi u le, n yaꞋankai Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Ɗa aza e Levi a shamgbai a gaɗi vu kirukpa ku na a yaꞋankai le. A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le, ele ɗa Jesuwa m Bani n Kadimiyelu n Shebaniya m Buni n Sherebeya m Bani n Kenani. Ɗa a yaꞋin kavasa n ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka utsura u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Ɗa aza e Levi a nanpa a, anan Jesuwa n Kadimiyelu m Bani n Hashabiya n Petahiya, a shamgbai kashani e ɗekei uma a danai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">&lt;&lt;Ɗa̱nga̱i kashani i cikpa Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:5">Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱ ka na ki n ugiti ba kpamu ki n uteku ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">Ucikpi a kubana u kula ku gbayin ku nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 9:5">kula ku na ku laꞋi n una̱singai n ucikpi.<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu avu ɗa endeꞋin, avu ɗa vuza na vu yaꞋin gaɗi, n a̱da̱nga̱ a̱ Ka̱shile n azangata a gaɗi. Avu ɗa kpamu vu yaꞋin iɗika n ili i na yi punu a i ɗa. Avu ɗa vuza na vu yaꞋin mala n ili i na yi punu. Avu ɗa vuza na vu yaꞋin wuma ra̱ka̱. Ɗa kpamu ili i wuma i gaɗi yi a kuyaꞋanka wu a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="NEH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, avu ɗa vu zagbai Aburam. Vu uta̱ka̱ ni a iɗika i Ur vu Kalidiya, ɗa vu sabaꞋi ni kula Ibirahi. <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Vu ene yi ta̱ wi ta̱ n ka̱ɗu ka singai wa̱ a̱ nu, ɗa vu yaꞋin uzuwakpani n a̱yi vi ta̱ e kuneke ntsukaya n ni iɗika ya aza a KanaꞋana n aza a Hitiya n aza a Amoriya n aza a Periziya n aza a Jebusiya n aza a Girigeshiya. Vu shatangu ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu, adama a na avu vuza vu usuɓi ɗa.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />&lt;&lt;Vu ene ta̱ atakaci a ikaya i tsu a iɗika i Masar, ɗa kpamu vu panai ma̱shi me le a̱ ka̱kina̱ ka mala mashili. <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Vu yaꞋan ta̱ i li mereve n a̱bunda̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono FiriꞋauna koɓolo n nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma ulinga u ni, n uma a iɗika i ni, adama a na vu yeve ta̱ tsu na o doroi ikaya i tsu. Ta vu yaꞋin kula nannai, kula ku na vi n kuɗa ali ananna. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Vu pecei mala kure a̱ a̱shi ikaya i tsu, ɗa a walai punu a mere ma mala ma a iɗika i ɗekpu. Ɗa vu niꞋwa̱ta̱ngi aza a na i o kutono le a mala ma, tsu na katali ka̱ tsu niꞋwa̱n a mala. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />N kanna vu wala ta̱ kelime ke le n kabashi ke keleshu adama a na u yotsongu le uye, n kayin tamkpamu vu wala ta̱ e kelime ke le n kabashi ke keleshu ka kutashi ka akina adama a na wa akana ka le ubuta̱ u na i a kubana. <verse eid="NEH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />Ɗa vu cipa̱i a kusan ku Sinai, ɗa vu yaꞋin kadanshi n ikaya i tsu ɗe. Vu nekei le wila̱ n ili i kutono n kuyotsongusu ku singai ku nu. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Ɗa vu yotsongi le e yeve kanna ka ciɗa ka ashibi, ka̱ta̱ o tono kaꞋa mayin, ɗa vu nekei le wila̱ u nu n kadanshi ka̱ nu n ili i kutono u kagbashi ka̱ nu Musa. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Ana kambulu ka̱ ka̱na̱i le, ɗa vu nekei le mana, kpamu ana a panai kakuli ɗa vu nekei le mini ma na muta̱i a ka kpanlai, ɗa vu danai le a bana a lyaꞋa uka̱ni wu iɗika ya, ka̱ta̱ yo okpo yi uka̱ni i le i na vu kucinakai le.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Ama ikaya i tsu a yaꞋin a̱ra̱ɗi n ugbamukaci, ɗa a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono wila̱ u nu. <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />N ili mereve i na i na vu yaꞋan ki le, ɗa a cinukpai n i ɗa. Ɗa a yaꞋin ugbamukaci, ɗa kpamu a̱ kpa̱ɗi kupana ukuna, a ugbamiwasuvu u le, ɗa a̱ la̱nsa̱i vuza kelime vu na u kubonoko le a iɗika i tsugbashi a Masar. Ama avu Ka̱shile ka kucinukpa unushi kaꞋa, vuza va asuvayali n ka̱sa̱Ꞌa̱, kpamu vu tsu yaꞋan wupa gogo ba, vuza vu ucigi u na wi a kusabaꞋa ba. Avu Ka̱shile vu varuku le ba. <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Ko ana a yaꞋankai ka̱ci ke le ka̱ma̱li ka viyum ki iyoci i medendem, ɗa a danai, &lt;Na ɗa Ka̱shile ka na ka̱ utuka̱i tsu a iɗika i Masar,&gt; Na lo kugoyi ku ɗa a yaꞋankai nu Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="NEH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />Ama vu varuku le a meremune ba, adama a asuvayali a̱ bunda̱i a̱ nu. Kabashi ke keleshu ka̱ ka̱sukpa̱ kutono le n kanna ba, kpamu kabashi ka akina ka̱ ka̱sukpa̱ ku akana ka le uye n kayin ba. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Vu nekei le Ayinviki a singai a na o kuyotsongu le, vu kpaɗa̱ ku neke le ilikulyaꞋa i mana ba, ko tana vu sa̱nga̱ le mini ɗa baci a panai kakuli ba. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />A̱ya̱ amangere avu a̱ kula̱na̱ le e meremune, a namba ili ba, ntogu n le n kporo ba, ene ele kpamu a shitasa ba.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />&lt;&lt;Ɗa vu nekei le tsugbayin n uduniya kakau, ɗa vu pecekei le iɗika. Ɗa a lyaꞋi iɗika i Heshibon i mogono Sihon n kuvon, n iɗika i Bashan i mogono Ogu. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Ɗa vu zuwai muku n le n yimkpa tsu azangata a gaɗi. Ɗa vu tukai le a iɗika i na vi yaꞋin uzuwakpani vi ta̱ e kuneke ikaya i le. <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Ɗa ntsukaya n le n uwai a lyaꞋi uka̱ni wi iɗika i KanaꞋana, ɗa vu lyai le melentsu vu bana vu lyaꞋi irala i le n kuvon. Ɗa vu nekei aza a KanaꞋana ekiye e le, nu ngono n uma a iɗika ya dem adama a na a yaꞋanka le tsu na a cikalai. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Uma a̱ nu isa ta̱ likuci yi ukanji, n iɗika i na yi n tsuta̱ ka̱u. Ɗa isai iꞋuwa n ili i singai-singai i na yi punu n ayinva a na a̱ ga̱va̱i ɗe n ashina a itacishi nu nɗanga n zaitu nu nɗanga ma̱ umaci n a̱bunda̱i. Ɗa a lyaꞋi, a̱ cuwa̱i, ali ɗa a yaꞋin i kyamba, ɗa a panai uyoꞋo wi ili singai i na avu vu yaꞋankai le gbani.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />&lt;&lt;Ama ɗa a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kupana a yaꞋin ugbamukaci, ɗa a vadalukpakai wila̱ u nu kucina̱. Ɗa unai eneki a̱ nu, aza a na odokushi le o bono wa̱ a̱ nu. Nannai ɗa a yaꞋankai nu unushi wa̱ a̱bunda̱i. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Adama a nannai ɗa vu nekei le ekiye a irala i le aza a na a takacikai le. A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci e le, ɗa a̱ tuka̱i nu n ma̱shi me le, ɗa tana vu panakai le ɗe gaɗi, vu panai asuvayali e le ɗa vu suki aza a na a isai le ekiye a irala i le. <verse eid="NEH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Ama a makyan ma na a̱ ciya̱i wuvuki, ɗa o doku a yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a̱ nu. Ɗa vu nekei le ekiye a irala i le, a lyaꞋakai le tsugono. N nannai dem, a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i n ma̱shi me le wa̱ a̱ nu, ɗa vu panakai le ɗe gaɗi, a makyan dem vu tsu isa le ta̱ adama a ucigi wa̱ a̱bunda̱i u nu. <verse eid="NEH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Vu ɓarangu le ta̱ adama a na o bono o tono wila̱ u nu, ama ɗa a yaꞋin ugbamukaci a iwain kutono wila̱ u nu, a yaꞋin unushi ɗa o goyoi kadanshi ka̱ nu. Ko a na wo okpoi sai vuma u tono wila̱ ɗaɗa u kuciya̱ wuma. Ɗa a yaꞋin ugbamukaci n ugbamiwasuvu, a iwain kutono kadanshi ka̱ nu. <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Adama a ucigi u nu, vu yongo ta̱ n e le a̱ya̱ n a̱bunda̱i, vu suki n Ayinviki a̱ nu a yaꞋankai le kadanshi a̱ una̱ u eneki a̱ nu. Ama n nannai dem ɗa a iwain kupanaka wu. Ɗa vu doku vu nekei le ekiye uduniya u yoku u lyaꞋakai le tsugono. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Ama adama a ucigi u gbayin u nu, vu una le ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱ ba. Adama a na avu Ka̱shile vuza va asuvayali ɗa.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />&lt;&lt;Gogo na Ka̱shile ka̱tsu vuzagbayin, vuza vu tsura vuza vu ili i wovon vuza na u tsu shatangu uzuwakpani, n vuza vu ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba, ka̱ta̱ vu goyo atakaci a̱ tsu ba. Atakaci a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i wa̱ a̱tsu nu ngono n tsu n aza e kelime a̱tsu n anan ganu a̱tsu n eneki a̱ tsu n ikaya i tsu n uma a̱ nu ra̱ka̱, ili i na i ɗikai a makyan ma ngono ma aza a Asuriya ali a̱ kuta̱wa̱ ayin a nampa. <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Ama ɗa vu yaꞋankai tsu kasingai ni ili i na i ciya̱i tsu ra̱ka̱, vu yaꞋankai tsu kamayun ko a na wo okpoi tsu nusaka wu ta̱. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Ngono n tsu n aza kelime a̱ tsu n anan ganu a̱tsu n ikaya i tsu o tono kuyotsongusu ku nu ba. A zuwa atsuvu e le a̱ wila̱ u nu ba. Ko feu a panaka kadanshi ka na vu danai le ba. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Ko a na wo okpoi a̱ ga̱nda̱ka̱ wu ba a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ kagbanigbani ke le ba. Ko a na wo okpoi i ta̱ n tsugono ci le, kpamu a pana ta̱ uyoꞋo u kasingai ka̱ nu. Vu nekei le iɗika i tsuta̱ n a̱bunda̱i. <verse eid="NEH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />La̱na̱ a̱tsu agbashi a ɗa ci, a iɗika i na vu nekei ikaya i tsu, a lyaꞋa umaci wu nɗanga n ili i na yi punu, a̱tsu ɗa na tana agbashi a ɗa. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Adama a unushi u tsu, uciyi wa̱ a̱bunda̱i wo okpoi ekiye o ngono n na vu zuwakai tsu, a ikyamba i tsu n ili ku zuwa i tsu, ngono ma a kuyaꞋan tsu na ugaꞋin le. A̱tsu tsu okpoi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uma ushuki kutono wila̱ wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />&lt;&lt;Adama ili i na i ciya̱i tsu ra̱ka̱, ɗa a̱tsu uma a Isaraila ci a kuyaꞋan uzuwakpani u nampa, kpamu ci a kuɗana u ɗa. Aza e kelime a̱ tsu n aza e Levi n anan ganu a̱ tsu ɗa a zuwai a̱ta̱mba̱ri e le.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />&lt;&lt;Na ɗa ula a uma a na a zuwai ekiye a katagarda ka uzuwakpani ka na a lapai n ka̱ta̱mba̱ri ka, a̱yi Nehemiya gomuna maku ma Hakaliya n Zedekiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Ula anan ganu a na tankpamu a zuwa ekiye a katakarda ka, ele ɗa Seraya n Azariya n Irimiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />n Pashuru n Amariya n Malikiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />n Hatushi n Shebaniya n Maluki, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />n Harim n Meremotu n Obodiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />n Daniyan n Gineton n Baruku, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />n Meshulam n Abija n Mijamin, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />n MaꞋaziya n Biligai n Shemaya. <verse eid="NEH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Ula aza e Levi tankpamu ele ɗa, Jesuwa maku ma Azaniya m Binuyi vu kpaꞋa ku Henadadu, n Kadimiyelu, <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />n aza e le, Shebaniya n Hodiya n Kelita n Pelaya n Hanan, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />n Mika n Rehobu n Hashabiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />n Zakuru n Sherebiya n Shebaniya, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />n Hodiya m Bani m Beninu. <verse eid="NEH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Na ɗa ula aza e kelime a na a zuwai ekiye e le, ele ɗa, Paroshi n Pahatu-mowabu n Elam n Zatu m Bani, <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />m Buni n Azagada n Bebayi. <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />n Adonija n Bigawai n Adini, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />n Ateru n Hizekiya n Azuru, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />n Hodiya n Hashum n Bezayi, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />n Harifa n Anatotu n Nebayi, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />n Magapisha n Meshulam n Heziru, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />n Meshezabelu n Zadoku n Jaduwa, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />n Pelatiya n Hanan n Anaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />n Hosiya n Hananiya n Hashubu, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />n Haloshi n Piliha n Shobeku, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />n Rehum n Hashabana n Maseya, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />n Ahija n Hanan n Anan, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />n Maluka n Harim m BaꞋanahu. <verse eid="NEH 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Uma a na a buwai ele ɗa, anan ganu n aza e Levi n aza a̱ kindi ku utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin n aza a ishipa n aza a ulinga wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a Gbayin n aza a na e pecei ka̱ci ke le n uma a iɗika adama a na o tono wila̱ u Ka̱shile. Ele na ra̱ka̱ n a̱ma̱ci e le n muku n le olobo nu nkere, aza a na e kuyeve ili i na i a kudanasa, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />ɗa a gbaɓai ka̱ci n aza e le n aza e kelime, ɗa a yaꞋin akucina a danai, yaꞋan una̱ u wuya u tono tsu ɗa baci tsu kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono wila̱ u Ka̱shila̱, u na e nekei Musa kagbashi ka̱ Ka̱shile. A kucinai a danai, i ta̱ o kutono wila̱ n kadanshi ka̱ ni n ili i kutono i vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu. <verse eid="NEH 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Ci yaꞋan ta̱ uzuwakpani tsu danai ci e kuneke nkere n tsu olo uma a iɗika ya ko olobo a̱ tsu a zuwa nkere n uma a iɗika ya ba. <verse eid="NEH 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Ɗa baci uma a iɗika ya a̱ tuka̱i nu ucanuku u kudenge u le a kanna ka Ashibi ko a kanna ka ciɗa ko yoku, ci a kutsula u ɗa ekiye e le ba, a̱ ka̱ya̱ ke cindere dem ci a kucimba ashina a̱ tsu ba, kpamu ci ta̱ a kucinukpaka yaba dem kutan ku ni.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />&lt;&lt;Tsu ushuku ta̱ yaba dem vu tsu wi ta̱ e kuneke ngura n tawun ma azurufa a̱ ka̱ya̱ dem adama a ulinga u kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />azurufa a nampa adama o boroji vu na a zagbai n kuneꞋen ku kiya ku kanna dem, nu nnama adama a alyuka o kusongu a kanna dem, a lyuka a kanna ka Ashibi n ka̱ɗiva̱ ko wotoi u savu, n ka̱ɗiva̱ ka na a zuwai, n kuneꞋen kakau ku ciɗa n kuneꞋe ka ku takpaka unushi wa aza Isaraila n ku ulinga u kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu. <verse eid="NEH 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />A̱tsu anan Ganu n aza e Levi n uma a na a buwai ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan kazagba adama a na tsu ciya̱ makyan a̱ ka̱ya̱ a na kpaꞋa dem ka̱ kutuka̱ nu nɗanga n na o kusonku alyuka o kusongu a katalikalyuka ka Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, tsu na wila̱ wa wi uɗani. <verse eid="NEH 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Ci yaꞋan ta̱ kpamu uzuwakpani ci ta̱ e kuneke ili ya ashina a̱ tsu i na i gita̱i kugeꞋwe n umaci wu nɗanga n na n gita̱i kugeꞋwe a̱ ka̱ya̱ dem a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="NEH 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Ci ta̱ kpamu a̱ kutuka̱ n muku mu ugiti n tsu nu mi ili i kuzuwa i tsu n ushiga wa anaka nu wu nlala a̱ ubuta̱ u anan ganu aza a na i a kuyaꞋan ulinga a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu tsu na wi uɗani. <verse eid="NEH 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Ci ta̱ a kuzuwa ili i ya ashina a̱ tsu i na i gita̱i ke geꞋwe a mpon n kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu. Ci ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ n anan ganu n kuneꞋe ku kiya ki ishina i na i gita̱i kugeꞋwe n kuneꞋe ku tsu dem n ku umaci wu nɗanga n ku ma̱kya̱n n ku maniꞋin ma zaitu. Ci ta̱ e kuneke ili i te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kupa wa aza e Levi aza a na i a ku isasa ili i te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ kupa a̱ likuci dem. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Ganu vu te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kumaci ku Haruna wi ta̱ a kushamgba n aza e Levi, a makyan ma na i a ki isa kuneꞋen ki ili kashina ya. Ele aza e Levi a i ta̱ a̱ ku uta̱ka̱ feu ili i te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kupa ka na isai va a banka a mpon n kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Aza a Isaraila n aza e Levi i ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ n kuneꞋen ku le ki i kashina n ma̱kya̱n n maꞋin ma zaitu a mpon. A̱ ubuta̱ u na ucanuku wu ulinga wu ubuta̱ u ciɗa wi. Ɗevu n Ubuta̱ u na anan ganu n aza a kuyaꞋan u linga, n aza a kindi n aza a ishipa i a̱ ida̱shi. Ci a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a̱ Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Aza a na a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a Urishelima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 9:1-34">1 Ar 9:1-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Aza e kelime a uma a Isaraila a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a Urishelima. Ɗa aza a na a buwai a yaꞋin kazagba adama a na a̱ tuka̱ n kumaci ku te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kumaci kupa, aza a na a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu a Urishelima likuci i ciɗa, ɗa a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i kumaci kuci ku da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i le. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Ɗa uma a zuwakai aza a na e nekei ka̱ci ke le a̱ da̱sa̱ngu a Urushelima una̱singai.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Na ɗa aza e kelime a uɓon u Yahuda aza a na a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a Urushelima, ko a na wo okpoi uma a Isaraila n anan ganu n aza e Levi n aza a na a kuyaꞋan ulinga a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile n kumaci ka aza a na a kuyaꞋanka Sulemanu ulinga a̱ da̱sa̱ngi yaba dem a̱ ubuta̱ u ni a uɓon u Yahuda. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Na ɗa ula aza e kelime a na uta̱i a Yahuda m Bayami a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a Urushelima. A kumaci ku Yahuda, ele ɗa, Atahiya maku ma Uziya matsukaya ma Zakariya a kpaꞋa ku Amariya maku ma Shefatiya, matsukaya ma Mahalale a kumaci ku Perezu. <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Maseya maku ma Baruku, matsukaya ma Koli-hoze a kpaꞋa ku Hazaya maku ma Adaya maku ma Joyaribu maku ma Zakariya a kumaci ku Shela. <verse eid="NEH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Kumaci ku Perezu ku na ki a̱ ida̱shi a Urushelima i ta̱ uma amangatawa̱na̱shi n amangatatsu n kunla̱i (468). Ra̱ka̱ vu le ali utsura a ɗa.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />A kumaci ku bayami ele ɗa, Salu maku ma Meshulam matsukaya ma Joweda a kpaꞋa ku Pedaya, maku ma Koliya, maku ma Maseya, maku ma Itahiyelu, maku ma Jeshaya, <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />aza a̱ ni tankpamu ele ɗa, Gabayi n Salayi i ta̱ uma amangatawunkuci n kamanga n kula̱i (928). <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Juwelu maku ma Ziciri a̱yi ɗa vuzagbayin vi le, n Yahuda maku ma Hasenuwa ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka vuzagbayin vu likuci ya.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Anan ganu ele ɗa, Jedaya maku ma Joyaribu n Jakin, <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />n Seraya maku ma Hilikiya, matsukaya ma Meshulam, a kpaꞋa ku Zadoku, maku ma Merayotu, maku ma Ahitubu, vuza vu kelime vu KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />n a̱ɓa̱nki a̱ ni, aza a na i a ulinga koɓolo punu a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka i ta̱ uma amangatawunkunla̱i n kamanga n e re (822). Adaya maku ma Jeroham, matsukaya ma pelaliya, maku ma Amazi, maku ma Zakariya, maku ma Pashuru, maku ma Malikiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />n a̱ɓa̱nki a̱ ni, aza e kelime ka iꞋuwa ele ɗa, uma amangatawenre n amangere n ere (242), Amashisayi maku ma Azarelu, matsukaya ma Ahazayi, a kpaꞋa ku Meshilemotu, maku ma Imeru, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />n a̱ɓa̱nki a ni ele ɗa, uma amangatawun n kamanga n kunla̱i (128). Vuza kelime vu le a̱yi ɗa Zabadiyelu maku ma Hagedolim.<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Aza e Levi tankpamu ele ɗa, Shemaya maku ma Hashubu, matsukaya ma Azirikam, a kpaꞋa ku Hashabiya, maku ma Bani, <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Shabetayi n Jozabadu ele ɗa, aza e kelime ka aza e Levi, aza a na o kukondo ulinga u pulai u KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile. <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Mataniya maku ma Mika, matsukaya ma Zabadi, a kpaꞋa ku Asafa, a̱yi ɗa vuza na u tsu canana ishipa i kucikpa i baci avasa, Bakubukiya vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a̱ ni, a̱yi ɗa ka̱ɓa̱nki ka Mataniya n Abuda maku ma Shamuwa, maku ma Galalu, maku ma Jedutun. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Aza e Levi a na i a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i ciɗa ele ɗa, uma amangatawenre n amanga̱na̱shi n a̱na̱shi (284).<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Aza a kinda ku utsutsu ele ɗa, Akubu n Talumon n a̱ɓa̱nki e le, aza a na a tsu inda utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin ele ɗa, uma amangatawun n amangatatsunkupa n e re (172).<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Kagimi ka uma a Isaraila, n anan ganu n aza e Levi, yaba dem u da̱sa̱ngi a̱ ubuta̱ u ni a̱ likuci i Yahuda.<verse eid="NEH 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Ama aza a ulinga wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbanyin i ta̱ ida̱shi a kusan ku Ofelu. Ziha n Gishipa ele ɗa aza a ulinga A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Vuzagbayin va aza e Levi a na i a Urushelima a̱yi ɗa Uzi maku ma Bani matsukaya ma Hashabiya, a kpaꞋa ku Mataniya maku ma Mika a kumaci ku Asafa ɗa. Kumaci ku nampa ku ɗa aza e kelime ka aza a ishipa a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Aza a ishipa a yaꞋan ta̱ ulinga tsu na mogono ma danai le a yaꞋan a kanna dem.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahiya maku ma Meshezabelu, a kumaci ku Zera maku ma Yahuda, a̱yi ɗa ka̱shi ko mogono ma Pashiya a ukuna wi ili ra̱ka̱ i uma a Isaraila.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Ukuna u likuci i kenkeꞋen n a̱pula̱ka̱ e le, uma a Yahuda o yoku i ta̱ ida̱shi a Kiriyatu-araba n likuci i kenkeꞋen i ni, a Dibon n likuci i kenkeꞋen i ni, Jekabizelu n likuci i kenkeꞋen i ni. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Ɗa kpamu a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i Jesuwa n Molada, a Betu-peletu, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />N Hazaru-shuwalu, m Biyasheba n likuci i kenkeꞋen i ni. <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />N Zikilagu n Mekona n likuci i kenkeꞋen i ni. <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />N likuci i Eni-romon n Zora n Jarumutu. <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />N Zanowa n Adulam ni i likuci i kenkeꞋen i le, a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a Lakishi n a̱pula̱ka̱ a na i ɗevu n a̱yi, n Azeka n likuci i kenkeꞋen i ni. Ta a̱ da̱sa̱ngi ɗe nannai ili i na i ɗikai a Biyasheba ali a kubana ka̱ɗa̱ka̱i ka Hinomu.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Ntsukaya m Bayami tankpamu a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a Geba n Mikamashi n Ayiya m Betelu n likuci i kenkeꞋen i ni. <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Ɗa a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i Anatotu n Nobu n Hananiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />N Hazoru n Rama n Gitiyim, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />N Hadida n Zeboyim n Nebalatu, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Lodu n Ono n ka̱ɗa̱ka̱i ka aza a ulinga wa ekiye.<verse eid="NEH 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Ɗa e pecei aza e Levi o yoku aza a na i a Yahuda, a zuwai le a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a uɓon wu iɗika i Bayami.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Anan ganu n aza e Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Na ɗa anan ganu n aza e Levi a na o bonoi n ugbashi ele ɗa, Zarubabelu maku ma Shiyatiyelu n Jesuwa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:1">Anan ganu</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 12:1">Ele ɗa Serayiya n Irimiya n Ezira, <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amariya n Maluka n Hatushi,<verse eid="NEH 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />N Shekaniya n Rehum n Meremotu, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />n Ido n Ginetoyi n Abija,<verse eid="NEH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Mijamin n MaꞋadiya n Biliga,<verse eid="NEH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaya n Joyaribu n Jedaya,<verse eid="NEH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu n Amoku n Hilikiya n Jedaya. Ele ɗa aza e kelime anan ganu koɓolo na aza e le a ayin Jesuwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Aza Levi ele ɗa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 12:8">Jesuwa m Binuyi n Kadimiyelu n Sherebiya n Yahuda n Mataniya vuza na a̱yi n aza a̱ na a ci canana ishipa i kucikpa.<verse eid="NEH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Bakubukiya n Uni n aza a̱ ni a na a̱ tsu ushuku ishipa.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumaci ku Jesuwa ganu vu gbayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Jesuwa u matsai Joyakim, Joyakim u matsai Eliyashibu, Eliyashibu u matsai Joyada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Joyada u matsai Janata, Janata tankpamu u maci Jaduwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Na ɗa ula aza e kelime ka iꞋuwa yi ikaya i anan ganu a ayin a na Joyakim wi ganu vu gbanyin, ele ɗa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Meraya vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Seraya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Hananiya ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Irimiya,<verse eid="NEH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Meshulam ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Ezira;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:13">Jehohanan ɗa vuza vu kelime ku kpaꞋa ku Amariya.<verse eid="NEH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Janata ɗa vuza vu kelime ku kpaꞋa ku Maluka Isufu ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Shebaniya.<verse eid="NEH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Adana ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Harim, Helekayi ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Merayotu.<verse eid="NEH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Zakariya ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Ido,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:16">Meshulam ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Gineton.<verse eid="NEH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Zikiri ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Abiya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:17">i ta̱ kpamu n vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Miniyamin. Pilitayi ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku MoꞋadiya.<verse eid="NEH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Shamuwa ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Biliga,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:18">Jahonata ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Shemaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Matenayi ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Joyaribu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:19">Uzi ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Jedaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Kalayi ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Salu</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:20">Eberu ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Amoku.<verse eid="NEH 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Hashabiya ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpa ku Hilikiya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:21">Netanelu ɗa vuza vu kelime vu kpaꞋa ku Jedaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />A makyan ma na Dariyu wi o tsugono tsu Pashiya ɗa a ɗanai ula aza e kelime a iꞋuwa yi ikaya ya aza e Levi n anan ganu a ayin Eliyashibu, ele ɗa Joyada n Johanan n Jaduwa. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Ɗa kpamu a ɗanai ula aza e kelime a iꞋuwa yi ikaya ya aza e Levi a katagarda ka tsumani a ayin a Johanan maku ma Eliyashibu. <verse eid="NEH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Na ɗa ula aza e kelime a iꞋuwa ya aza e Levi. Hashabiya n Sherebiya n Jesuwa maku ma Kadimiyelu n aza e le a na a tsu shamgba e kelime ka aza a na a tsu canana ishipa i kucikpa, kapashi kete a ku canana kete a̱ kushuku, tsu na Dawuda vuma vu Ka̱shile u danai.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Aza a kindi ku utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a na i uɓon u kunu ku kuzuwa ele ɗa, Mataniya n Bakubukiya n Obodiya n Meshulam, n Talumon n Akubu. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Ra̱ka̱ uma a nampa ɗa a yaꞋin ulinga a ayin a Joyakim maku ma Jesuwa, maku ma Jozadaku, a ayin a na Nehemiya wi o tsugono. A makyan ma nanlo Ezira kaɗani ɗa ganu.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erengi mashilya ma Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />A makyan ma na i e kerengu Urushelima va, ɗa e ɗekei aza e Levi a̱ ubuta̱ u na i dem, a̱ ta̱wa̱i n e le a Urushelima adama a na a yaꞋan ka̱ɗiva̱ ke kerengu n ishipa i kucikpa n tsuwaꞋi tsu ugogi n umolu nu ndele. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />A̱ tuka̱i n aza a ishipa kakau a na i a̱ likuci i kenkeꞋen i na yi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n Urushelima n likuci i kenkeꞋen i Netofa, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />ili i na i ɗikai a Betu-giliga, n uɓon u Geba n Azamavetu, adama a na aza a ishipa a maꞋasaka ta̱ ka̱ci ke le iꞋuwa uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n Urushelima. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Ana anan ganu n aza e Levi a takpai nshinda̱ n le, ɗa a takpai nshinda̱ n uma n utsutsu n mashilya ma̱ likuci ka.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Ɗa n zuwai aza e kelime a Yahuda a kumba gaɗi vu mashilya ma. Ɗa kpamu n zuwai aza e kelime a ishipa u gboku u re o tono mashilya ma. U gboku u te u tono uɓon u ɗakai ali a kubana a̱ Utsutsu u Ka̱kiza̱. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Ɗa Hoshaya n kagimi ka aza e kelime a Yahuda o tonoi le, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />n Azariya n Ezira n Meshulam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />n Yahuda m Bayami n Shemaya n Irimiya feu o tonoi le. <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />Koɓolo ka anan ganu ko yoku ko tonoi le n a̱ lika̱i igbala n Zakariya maku ma Janata matsukaya ma Shemaya a kpaꞋa ku Mataniya, n maku ma Mikaya n maku ma Zakuru n maku ma Asafa, <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a̱ ni, anan Shemaya n Azarelu n Milalayi n Gilalayi n MaꞋayi n Netanelu n Yahuda, koɓolo n Hanani. ra̱ka̱ vu le i ta̱ n ucanuku wi waꞋashi tsu na Dawuda vuma vu Ka̱shile u danai, Ezira ɗa malum ma na mi o kutono n e le. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />A lyaꞋi kelime nu nwalu ili i na i ɗikai a̱ Utsutsu u a̱shi a̱ mini a kumbai adasukpatsu a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u na u laꞋi n ugaɗi a mashilya ma̱ likuci i Dawuda ya. O tonoi n tsugaɗi tsu kpaꞋa ku Dawuda ali a kubana a̱ Utsutsu u Mini n tsugaɗi tsu likuci i Urushelima.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Koɓolo ka aza a ishipa ke i re tankpamu o tonoi ugula̱ n uɓon u gaɗi u mashilya ma. Ɗa n tonoi le ali a gaɗi vu mashilya ma n kagimi ka uma, tsu tonoi n uɓon u kumaꞋa ku ugaɗi ku na a ci yaꞋan boroji ali a kubana a Mashilya ma Wanshi. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Ɗa tsu tonoi n Utsutsu u Ifrayimu, n Utsutsu u Jeshana, n Utsutsu wa Adan, n kumaꞋa ku ugaɗi ku Hananelu n KumaꞋa ku ugaɗi Amangatawun, a kubana Utsutsu wu Nlala. Ana tsu yawai a̱ Utsutsu wa aza Kindi ɗa tsu shamgbai.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Ta aza ishipa a ugboku u re wa a shamgbai a̱ ubuta̱ u le a kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile. Ta mpa feu n kagimi ka nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ci yaꞋin nannai, <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka anan ganu aza a̱ kulika̱ igbala ele ɗa, Eliyakim n MaꞋaseya n Miniyamin n Mikaya n Eliyoni n Zakariya n Hananiya feu. <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />N anan MaꞋaseya n Shemaya n Eliyaza n Uzi, n Jehohanan n Malikiya n Elam n Eza feu. Jezarahiya u tonoi n aza a ishipa ya, ɗa a ci canana ishipa n utsura ka̱u. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />A kanna ka nanlo kaꞋa a yaꞋin kuneꞋe n a̱bunda̱i, ɗa uma a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱ ka̱u adama a na Ka̱shile ka yaꞋanka le ta̱ ili ma̱za̱nga̱. A̱ma̱ci n muku feu a̱ za̱nga̱na̱ ta̱. Ali aza a daꞋin a panai yoroli i ma̱za̱nga̱ a Urushelima.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ofoɓuso adama a ulinga wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Makyan ma nanlo maꞋa a zuwai aza a na a kinda mpon n na a tsu zuwa ili i kashina i na uma o ɓolongi, n ili i kashina i na i gita̱i kugeꞋwe n ili i te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kupa i na a̱ tsu tuka̱. Uma i ta̱ a̱ kuka̱na̱ kuɓolongu ili ya ashina a na i uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n likuci ya, ka̱ta̱ a̱ tuka̱ punu o mpon ma adama anan ganu n aza e Levi, tsu na kuyotsongusu ku dansai, ɗa tana aza a Yahuda a panai uyoꞋo tsu na anan ganu n aza e Levi i a kuyaꞋan. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Ɗa anan ganu n aza e Levi o tonoi wila̱ u kucikpa Ka̱shile ke le, n wila̱ u kutakpa nshinda̱, tsu na Dawuda n maku ma̱ ni Sulemanu a danai. Ta feu aza a ishipa n aza a kindi ku utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a yaꞋin nannai. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />N ayin a cau ɗe, a makyan ma Dawuda mogono n Asafa, aza e kelime ki ishipa i ta̱ lo, ishipa i kucikpa Ka̱shile feu yi ta̱ lo. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />A ayin a Zerubabelu n ayin e Nehemiya, aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ e neke ta̱ aza a ishipa n aza a kinda ku utsutsu ili i na a zuwai le e neke. ɗa kpamu a takpakai aza e Levi kuneꞋe ku le, ɗa aza e Levi a feu a takpakai kumaci ku Haruna anan ganu kuneꞋe ku le.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kulapulu ku ukocishi ku Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />A kanna ka nanlo kaꞋa e kecei katagarda ka̱ wila̱ u Musa atsuvu a uma dem a kupana ɗa a cinai punu uɗani a danai, ka̱ta̱ vuza vu Amon n vuza vu Mowabu a uwa a̱ ubuta̱ u uma a̱ Ka̱shile ba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:3-5">Wil 23:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Adama a na aza a Amon n aza a Mowabu e neꞋe aza a Isaraila ilikulyaꞋa n mini mo kusoꞋo ba, ana uta̱i a iɗika i Masar. Ɗa a kucikpa e nekei Balam ikebe u yaꞋanka uma a̱ Ka̱shile una̱wuya, ama ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu ko bonokoi una̱wuya wo okpoi una̱singai. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Ana aza a Isaraila a panai wila̱ u Musa wa, ɗa o rononoi ka̱ci ka̱ le a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko omoci.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Kafu makyan ma nampa ci na ɗe a zuwa Eliyashibu ganu u la̱na̱ unu a kuzuwa ku KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu. Adama a na wi ta̱ n kumaci n Tobiya, <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />ɗa u nekei Tobiya kunu ku kuzuwa ku gbanyin ku na ishi a tsu zuwa ili i kashina n ki ili i ma̱gula̱ni n ku ucanuku u na a ci yaꞋanka ulinga A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin, n ili ite a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kupa n ma̱kya̱n ma savu n maniꞋin ma zaitu tsu na e kecei adama aza e Levi n aza a ishipa n aza a kindi ku utsutsu wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin, n kuneꞋe adama anan ganu.<verse eid="NEH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Ana ili i nanlo i gita̱i, mpa punu a Urushelima ba, adama a na a̱ ka̱ya̱ kamangankupa n ke i re ko tsugono tsu Atazesu vuza vu Babila, ɗa m banai u mogono. Makyan kenu ɗa n folonoi mogono adama a na m bono a Urushelima. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Ana m bonoi a Urushelima, ɗa n cinai ili i gbani-gbani i na Eliyashibu u yaꞋin, u foɓusokoi Tobiya kunu punu anunu a ulanga u KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Ɗa n yaꞋin wupa u ka̱u, mu utuka̱i n ucanuku u Tobiya ra̱ka̱ n taɗuki u ɗa pulai. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />N zuwai a takpa nshinda̱ n unu ka tsu na wila̱ u danai, ɗa n bonokoi punu ucanuku u KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile, koɓolo n kuneꞋe ki ili kashina n ki ili i ma̱gula̱ni. <verse eid="NEH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Ɗa n yevei uma e neke utafu u na a danai le e neke ba, adama a nannai ɗa aza e Levi n aza a ishipa n aza a na o tsu tono n ukuna wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a sumai o bonoi a shina e le. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Ɗa n dansukai aza a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ a me ecei le, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa i ka̱sukpa̱i kpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile tsu nampa?&gt;&gt; Ɗa n ɗekei aza e Levi n aza a ishipa n zuwai le o bono a̱ ubuta̱ wu ulinga u le.<verse eid="NEH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Ɗa aza a Yahuda ra̱ka̱ a̱ tuka̱i n ili ite a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kupa ki ili i kashina n ma̱kya̱n ma savu n maniꞋin ma zaitu punu a̱ unu a kuzuwa. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Ɗa n zuwai Shelemiya ganu n Zadoku kaɗani n Pedaya vuza vu Levi, a̱ la̱na̱ n unu a kuzuwa. Ɗa kpamu n zuwai Hanan maku ma Zakuru, matsukaya ma Mataniya, wo okpo ka̱ɓa̱nki ke le, adama a na e yeve le ta̱ uma a̱ ma̱riki a ɗa, a zuwai le okpo aza e kupece ku aza e le ili i na uma a̱ tuka̱i. <verse eid="NEH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ciɓa nu mpa a kakuna ka nampa, ka̱ta̱ vu pura̱ngu ulinga wu usuɓi una n yaꞋin adama a KpaꞋa ku Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ ba, n adama a ulinga u na i a kuyaꞋan a kpaꞋa ka.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />A ayin a nanlo me ene ta̱ uma a Yahuda a kuyaꞋan ma̱kya̱n, n a zuwakai njaki le aburuma a ishina n ma̱kya̱n n umaci u mambulu n ucanuku kakau a̱ ku ta̱wa̱sa̱ka̱ a Urushelima a kanna ka Ashibi. Ɗa n dansukai le ka̱ta̱ e denge ucanuku wi ilikulyaꞋa kanna ka nanlo ba. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Uma a Taya aza a na i a̱ ida̱shi a Urushelima a̱ tuka̱ ta̱ n adan n ucanuku kakau wi idengushi i le wa aza a Yahuda a kanna ka Ashibi, punu Urushelima. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Ɗa n dansukai aza a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ a Yahuda n danai le,&lt;&lt;Ili i gbani-gbani i yiɗa̱i yi a kuyaꞋan na? Yi a̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ kanna ka Ashibi. <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Ta ikaya i ɗa̱ i yaꞋin nannai ba? Ali ɗa Ka̱shile ka tuka̱i tsu n ma̱dukpa̱ a̱ likuci i nampa ba? Gogo na i ciga ta̱ i zuwa Ka̱shile yaꞋan wupa n aza a Isaraila, adama a kanna ka Ashibi ka na yi a̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Ɗa n zuwai a̱ ɓa̱ya̱ngu su utsutsu u Urushelima a̱ ugiti u kanna ka Ashibi n kulivi, ka̱ta̱ kpamu utsutsu wa u yongo uɓa̱ya̱ngi ali kanna ka Ashibi ka laza. Ɗa n zuwai aza a ulinga a̱ va̱ inda utsutsu, adama a na ka̱ta̱ a uwaka n ucanuku punu a kanna ka Ashibi ba. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Kute ku ɗa ko ku re ba aza a idengushi asai lo pulai vu mashilya ma̱ likuci i Urushelima ya ba. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Ama ɗa m ɓarangi le, n danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa yi a ku asusa paki n mashilya? Ɗa baci i doku i yaꞋin ili i nampa mi ta̱ a̱ kuka̱na̱ ɗa̱.&gt;&gt; Ili i ɗikai a kanna ka nanlo odoku a̱ ta̱wa̱ e kuden a kanna ka Ashibi ba. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Ɗa n zuwai aza e Levi a takpai nshinda̱ n le ka̱ta̱ a bana inda utsutsu, adama a na o tono wila̱ u kanna ka Ashibi ka ko yongo ciɗa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:22" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ciɓa nu mpa adama a ukuna u nampa, ka̱ta̱ vu pana asuvayali a̱ va̱ n ucigi u nu u ko wannai.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />A makyan ma nanlo, ɗa me enei aza a Yahuda n a̱bunda̱i a na a zuwai a̱ma̱ci aza a Ashidodu n aza a Amona n aza a Mowabu. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Muku n le n yoku a kuyaꞋan kadanshi n kelentsu ka aza a Ashidodu n kelentsu ka uma o yoku kau, ali a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kufuɗa kudansa n kelentsu ke le ka Yahuda. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Ɗa n dansukai le ka̱u, ɗa kpamu n yaꞋankai le una̱, n lapai aza a yoku e le ali n muɗa̱ a̱nji e le, n zuwai le a kucinai n Ka̱shile a danai,&lt;&lt;I o kudoku ku neke nkere n le uma a na i aza a Yahuda ba a zuwa, ko a ɗika muku n a̱ma̱ci n le ba. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Ɗa n danai le, icuꞋu i kuzuwa ka̱ a̱ma̱ci a nampa a ɗa i zuwai Sulemanu mogono ma Isaraila kuyaꞋan unushi ba? A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku uduniya dem babu mogono ma na ma yaꞋin ci ni. Ka̱shile ka̱ ni ka cigai ta̱, ali ɗa Ka̱shile ka zuwai ni wo okpoi mogono mi Isaraila ra̱ka̱, ama omoci a̱ ma̱ci a ɗa a zuwai ni u nusai. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Ci a̱ ku ushuku n ili i na yi a kuyaꞋan ba, ali ci yaꞋan kagbanigbani kanampa ka unambi wu usuɓi u Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, ali tsu kuzuwa omoci a̱ma̱ci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Maku me te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ muku mo olobo n Joyida, maku ma Eliyashibu ganu vu gbayin, u zuwai mekere ma Sanbalatu vuma vu Betu-horon. Ɗa n lokoi ni u ɗa̱ngulo. <verse eid="NEH 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ ciɓa n e le, adama a na a natukpa ta̱ ulinga u anan ganu n uzuwakpani wu ulinga u anan ganu n aza e Levi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Ta n takpakai anan ganu n aza e Levi nshinda̱ mi ili i na yi ya aza a Yahuda ba, n zuwai le ulinga, yaba dem n ulinga u ni. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Ɗa kpamu n foɓusoi tsu na a̱ ku ta̱wa̱sa̱ka̱ nu nɗanga n kuyaꞋanka alyuka o kusongu a makyan ma na wu untsai, n tsu na kpamu a̱ kutuka̱ ili i kashina i na i gita̱i kugeꞋwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ciɓa nu mpa.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>